<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- MATENGO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matei</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lijambu la Amboni ngati ejuandiki Matei</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matei</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mate</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lijambu la Amboni ngati ejuandiki</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matei</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Matei ndi kitabu simu kati jiitabu nsesi yeibii mu Lilaganu linyai lelilandi womi waka Yesu Kilisitu Nkombosi. Kila kitabu simu muitabu nsesi hei biikema “Injili” maana jaki “Lilaganu Linyai.” Baandika aka Matei na Maluko na Luka na Yohana baada jukukua Yesu. Abolewa ngaseamanyiki masoba boo gasakaka gukuandika Lijambu la Amboni ngati hejuandiki Matei, lakini kuwesika kitabu senze kiandikwi yaka 60 toka Yesu pajwasaliwa. Kabee pandu pabaandaki ngase pamanyikana, lakini bandu bingi ahobale kuwesikana baandiki ku Palesitina kabee kuwesikana ahandiki ku musi uku Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jojuandiki ndi Matei, jojwabi jojujopa kodi kwa bandu kabula Yesu ngaseanhagwi kuba mbolee waki. Kabee jwabia jumanyikana kuliina lengi lebilikema Lawi. Matei jwabia jumu kati ja banafunzi komi na abeli na jwaandakia lijambu leheli asomi biki Yaudi. Haga uwesa kugabona hotuhotu, ndaba alongali mumisitali jingi kupeta sitini mu Lilaganu la Mwandi. Matei julengiki kwaalangi bandu kupwaga Yesu ndi Kilisitu, na ndi Nkombosi jojuhaguliwi na Sapanga, jobundotila alota baka Sapanga kupwaga jutenda kuhika. Matei juandiki kabee majambu gingi mu lijambu mombo gagalongale Ubambu ukolongu waka Sapanga. Ayaudi baobalia Kilisitu jwiibia Bambu nkolongu jupundema pani ngati heabi aka bambu akolongu bangi bupunndema. Matei julonge kabee sakwaapala kupenga sebabia bakahobalia koni julandi Ubambu ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga ndi wi kiloho.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lijambu la Amboni ngati ejuandiki Matei ndi kitabu saa sapi kutumbuli mu Lilaganu Linyai ndaba jukombukii majambu gingi kuhuma mu Lilaganu la Mwandi. Sejuhandiki kilombanisa malaganu goka mabeli. Abolewa bingi apwaga ana, Matei kuwesikana julengiki kujiga ntindu wiitabu yaka Musa. Itabu yehei ndi itabu nhwanu yeitumbuli mu Lilaganu la Mwandi. Malandi gaka Yesu, gajwaalandila bandu kukitombi gagabii mu Lijambu la Amboni ngati ejuandiki matei mulipungu la Matei 5-7 galengana na Sapanga paampekia Musa Malagalaki kukitombi. Linga mulipungu Lukukomboka Malagalakilu 19:3-23:33.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabi mukitabu senze ndi ganga</para>
  <para style="io">Matei jutumbuli kuandika Lijambu la Amboni lendenu sukulongale kusaliwa kwaka Yesu Kilisitu na hejwatumbulia lihengu laki, mulipungu 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Mweni katai Matei julandi lihengu laka Yesu na mabolee gaki gingi, mulipungu 5-25.</para>
  <para style="io">Matei julongale mahengu gaka Yesu kupete kuwa kwaki nukuyoka kwaki, mulipungu 26-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Lukolu lwaka Yesu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Ganga ndi mahina gaka hoku baka Yesu Kilisitu, jojabii mu kibeleku saka Daudi, jojabii nsoko waka Ibulahimu. <verse eid="MAT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Ibulahimu ambelika Isaka na Isaka ambelika Yakobo na Yakobu ambelika Yuda naaka alongu baki. <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Yuda ambelika Pelesi na Zela, nyongo wabu jwabii Tamali, Pelesi ambelika Heziloni na Heziloni ambelika Alami, <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Alami ambelika Aminadabu na Aminadabu ambelika Nashoni na Nashoni ambelika Salumoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salumoni ambelika Boazi, nyongoo waka Boazi jojabii Lahabu na Boazi na Lutu bakabii azazi baka Obedi na Obedi ambelika Yese. <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Yese ambelika Bambu Nkolongu Daudi. Daudi ambelika Solomoni, nyongoo waki Solomoni bunkema Besisheba jojabii nhwanu waka Ulia. <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Solomoni ambelika Leoboamu na Leoboamu ambelika Abiya na Abiya ambelika Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asa ambelika Yeoshafati na Yeoshafati ambelika Yolamu na Yolamu na Yolamu ambelika Uzia, <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Uzia ambelika Yosamu na Yosamu ambelika Ahazi na Ahazi ambelika Hezekia, <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Hezekia ambelika Manase na Manase ambelika Amoni na Amoni ambelika Yosia, <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Yosia ambelika Yekonia na alongu baki, mu masoba gegala sakabii kipindi sa Ayaudi pabaapelika ku luhami ku Babeli.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Pababiya baapeliki Ayaudi ku luhami luku Babeli, na Yekonia ambelika Shealutieli na Shetieli ambelika Zelubabeli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zelubabeli ambelika Abiudi na Abiudi ambelika Eliakimu na Eliakimu ambelika Azoli, <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azoli ambelika Sadoki na Sadoki ambelika Akimu na Akimu ambelika Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eliudi ambelika Eleazali na Eleazali ambelika Matani na Matani ambelika Yakobu. <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Yakobu ambelika Josepu, jojabii nndomi waka Malia, nyongoo waka Yesu joakema Kilisitu Nkombosi.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Ndienu kwabi niibeleku Komi nu nsesi kutumbuli Ibulahimu mbaka Daudi ni ibeleku komi nu nsesi tumbuka Daudi mbaka Ayaudi pabaakamula kujenda kuluhami ku Babeli, ni ibeleku komi nu nsesi toka pabaakamula kujenda kuluhami mbaka kusaliwa kwaka Kilisitu Nkombosi.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusaliwa kwaka Yesu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Yesu Kilisitu jwasaliwa ana, Malia nyongoo waka Yesu jwabia jusumbiki Josepu. Lakini pa babiya bakoni nganukutama pamu ngati nndomi nu nhwanumundu, Malia jabonikana jubii ni kitumbu kupete uwesu wa Loho jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Josepu ndaba jabii mundu waamboni palongi jaka Sapanga, ngasejapai kumpoalihamu Malia, ndi japala kundeka kinunukinunu. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Pajwabia jwakoni jwakawasaliya lijambu leheli, Ntumi jukunani waka Bambu ampitila mundotu ampwagila, “Josepu mwana waka Daudi, wijogopa kunzuku Malia kuba nhwanu wako, ndaba kitumbu saki jupatiki ku uwesu waka Loho jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Jwiibelika mwana mwanalomi nawe wankema liina laki Yesu, ndaba jombi ndi jojwaakombula bandu baki kuhuma mu mahakau gabu.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Ndienu, haga goti gapitii ili litimia lilobi laka Bambu lejwapwaga kwi indela jaka mlota waka Sapanga, <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>“Linga, kamwali jwanga kuketanga na mwanalomi jwiitotula kitumbu, ambelika mwana mwanalomi, najombi bankema liina la Manueli.” Maana jaki, “Sapanga jubii pamu na twepani.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Ndienu, Josepu pa jwajumuka mu lugonu jatenda ngati ntumi jukunani eampwagila, anzukua Malia nhwanu waki, nukujenda naku kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Lakini ngasejagoni naku mbaka Malia pajabelika mwana mwanalomi. Najombi Josefu ankema liina laki Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ageni kuhuma upandi golipiti lyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Yesu jasaliwa ku musi guku Betelehemu, ku nndema uku Yudea, masoba Helodi pajwabii bambu nkolongu. Bandu baamanya gagiipitila mweni katai sukulingali ndondu babahuma upandi golipitii lyoba bahika ku Yelusalemu, <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>baalalukiya bandu, “Jubii kwaa mwana jojibiya bambu nkolongu jwa Ayaudi, jojusaliwi? Tujibweni ndondu jaki jipitii upandi golipiti lyoba, tuhikiki kungungamali.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Bambu nkolongu Helodi pajajoa ganiaga, jahangajiki ngamaa mmoju jaki, jombi pamu na bandu boti buku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Ndienu Helodi, jaakema pamu agolu akolongu boti na abola ba malagalaki jalalukiya bombi, “Boo, Kilisitu Nkombosi jwisaliwa kwako?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Nabombi bajibua, “Jisaliwa ku musi uku Betelehemu, ku nndema uku Yudea. Ndaba mlota waka Sapanga ejuandiki,<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>‘Mwabandu buku Betelehemu musi gogubii ku Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">mwanganya mwaasoku kati jaka kilongosi ba bandu buku Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">ndaba kwinu jiihuma kilongosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">jojaalongua bandu bangu buku Izilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Ndipala Helodi jaakema bandu bala baamanya gagipitila sukulingali ndondu su ujobu, ili bumpwagila muda gojipitila ndondu. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Ndienu jaatuma ku Betelehemu, japwaaga, “Nzendannya mukataputa sapi pajubii mwana hoju. Anamubweni mwihika kumbwagi na nane kabee niijenda kungungamali.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Ebajomula kunzoane bambu nkolongu batenda kuboka. Na ndondu jela jebabiya bijibweni upandi kolipitii lyoba jaalongulikiya nukujenda kujema pandu pajabii mwana pala. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Ebijibona ndondu jela, batoguli ngamaa. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Ndienu, bajingala nnyumba, bummbona mwana jola pamu na Malia nyongoo waka mwana, bapega magoti nukungungamali. Ndipala baogula mikoba jabu, nukumpeke nhupi yabu, zaabu nu ubani na mahuta gabagakema manemane.<verse eid="MAT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Sapanga jaakana mundotu biikelebuki kabee kwaka Helodi, ndienu bakelubuka mwa manyumba gabu kupete indela jengi.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutili ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Pababoka ageni bala, ntumi juku kunani jwaka Bambu ampitila Josepu mu ndotu, ampwagila, “Jumuka! Gunzukua mwana pamu na nyongoo, ntilila ku Misili. Mwakatama konioku mbaka enampwagila, ndaba Helodi jupala kunkoma mwana weajo.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Ndienu, Josepu jajumuka, anzukua mwana pamu na amabu baki ikilu ajelaje, nukujendane ku Misili. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Jatama hoku mbaka Helodi ejakuwa. Lijambu heli lahengika ili lilobi lejwapwaga Bambu kwi indela juku mlota litimia, “Nunkemaa mwana wangu kuhuma ku Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bana asaliwanu atenda kukomeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Helodi pajamanya baamanya gagipitila sukulinga ndondu bala babia ankongiki, jayomiki ngamaa. Jaamulisa bana boti akanalomi buku musi uku Betelehemu na baabii pambipi jabu, baabii na yaka ibeli na pai jaki akomika. Jwahenga hela kulengana na muda gobabia bumpwagi bandu bala.<verse eid="MAT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Ndienu, hegatimia malobi gajapwaga Mlota waka Sapanga jobunkema Yelemia,<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>“Sauti jajoaniki ku Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kilelu su usungu nkolongu nu kulobalake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Laheli jaalele bana baki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">wala ngakupala kuntulisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">ndaba boti awii.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhuma ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Helodi ejakuwa, ntumi juku nani jwaka Bambu ampitila Josepu mu ndotu ku Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>ampwagila, “Jumuka! Gunzukua mwana pamu na nyongoo waki nkelubuka kabee ku ndema uku Izilaeli, ndaba baapala kunkoma mwana hoju akuwike.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Ndienu, Josepu jajumuka, anzukua mwana pamu na nyongoo waki, nukukelabuka ku ndema uku Izilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Lakini Josepu ejajoa Alukelao mwana waka Helodi, jabii nkolongu juku Yudea jalisa kiteu sa atati baki, jajogopa kujenda hoku. Najombi ndaba babiya ankaniki mundotu jajenda upandi uku Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>ndienu jatama mmusi gobugukema Nazaleti. Ndi egatimia malobi gajapwaga kwi indela jaka alota baka Sapanga, “Bankema mundu kuhuma ku Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mmbatisa jaalandi bandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Masoba gala Yohana Mmbatisa jajenda, mulukoba luku Yudea, nukutumbuli kaalandi bandu. <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>Japwaaga, “Nkotuka kuhenga mahakau gino, ndaba Ubambu ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga guhegali.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Yohana ndi joandongalia mlota waka Sapanga Isaya pajapwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Mundu jujamali kulukoba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Munhandaliya Bambu indela jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">nnyosa indela jaki.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Yohana jaweti ingobu yeasoniki kwa mangoma gi kinyama sebikikema ngamia nu nkanda wa ngosi mukibunu saki. Posu jaki jabia mapai na busi gumwikioli. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Bandu bunzendila, kuhuma ku Yelusalemu na kuhuma misi yoti yuku Yudea kuhuma ndema yoti yeibii pambipi ja losi luku Yoludani. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Bajetakiya mahakau gabu nukugaleka, najombi jaabatisa mu losi luku Yoludani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Lakini pajaabona Afalisayu bingi naka Asadukayu bunhiki ili jaabatisa, jaapwagila, “Mwanganya mwi kibeleku si lijoka! Nya joantonyiki kujepa kutemuliwa na Sapanga kokwihikaje? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Nhenga mahengu gagalangi nndekaki mahakau gino. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Mwiwasali nhwesa kujepa kutemuliwa na Sapanga sukulipwagi, ‘Atati bitu Ibulahimu.’ Numpwagi sakaka, Sapanga juwesa kung'anambu malibu haga gabia bana baka Ibulaimu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Ndienu lipengu abei punhina ji mikongu, na henu nkongu gokapi wanga kupapa matunda gasapi biitenda kuguseku nukuguleke pamwotu. <verse eid="MAT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Nepani numbatisa kwa masi kulangi nndekaki mahakau gino. Lakini jojuhika munyuma jane jubii nu uwesu kupeta nepani, nane ngasembalika hata kujuku makobasi gaki. Jombi jambatisa kwa Loho jaka Sapanga na kwa mwotu. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Jombi jubi ni kipalu saki mumaboku gaki, ili jupeta ilebi yaki, ni inganu yaki jaibeka mukikoku, lakini mwegeu jagujosa kwa mwotu wanga kususuka.”<figure style="fig" alt="A person threshing wheat to separate the grains from the chaff" file="06 Threshing.jpg" size="col" ref="3:12">Mundu jupeta inganu</figure><verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atenda kumbatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maluko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-23">Luka 3:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Ndienu, Yesu jahuma ku Galilaya, jahika ku losi luku Yoludani, kubatiswa na Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Lakini Yohana jalenga kumpenga, sukupwaga, “Nepani ndi nembala kubatiswa nawe, kubi boo, wehapa guhika kwango?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Lakini Yesu anzibua, “Kuleka pe kubia ahelahe kwa sajeno, ndaba ndi ekupalika tutimisa goti gajupala Sapanga.” Ndienu Yohana jatenda kujetake kumbatisa Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Yesu pajajomula pee kubatiswa, jwapita mmasi. Apalapa kunani ku mahundi kwaka Sapanga kwatenda kuhogoka, ambona Loho jaka Sapanga jakahuluka ngati ngunda nu kumete panani jaki. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Sauti kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga jajoanika jakapwaga, “Jonzo ndi Mwanangu jonumpai, jojunenganile.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu jutenda kulengwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maluko 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Ndipala Loho jaka Sapanga jundongua Yesu mbaka kulukoba ili julengwa ni Lijobi. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Japungiki kula posu masoba komi nsesi muhi ni ikilu, pajajomula jumbina inzala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Ndienu Lijobi, lunhikila nukunkolo, “Ana wehapa wa Mwana waka Sapanga, ugapwagila malibu aga gabiya mabumunda.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Yesu jajibua, “Aandiki mu Maandiku gaka Sapanga, ‘Mundu ngasejuwesa kutama kupete mabumunda pena, ila kwa kila lilobi lejupwaga Sapanga.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Ndipala Lijobi lunzukua Yesu mbaka ku Yelusalemu, kumusi wa asapi, ambeka panani jikipagaa sa Nyumba jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>Ndienu ampwagila, “Ana wehapa wa Mwana waka Sapanga, lilekala pai, ndaba aandiki mu Maandiku gaka Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Sapanga jaatuma atumi baki bu kunani bagukenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">nu kugujanga mumaboku gabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">ili walikobando kwaku mu lilibu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Aandiki kabee mu Maandiku gaka Sapanga, ‘Wandenga Bambu, Sapanga wako.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Ndipala, Lijobi anzukua kabee mbaka panani ji kitombi kilasu, andangia ubambu ukolongu wa ndema yoka na nu ukolongu waki woti. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>Ndienu lumpwagila, “Yenze yoti misinugupekia ana gunyinamii nu kungungamali.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Boka neapa Lijobi wee! Aandiki mu Maandiku gaka Sapanga, ‘Gungungamaliya Bambu Sapanga waku, nukuntumakii jombi kajika jaki.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Ndienu Lijobi lundeka Yesu, na atumi bu kunani kwaka Sapanga bahika kuntumakii.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jutumbuli kaalandi bandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maluko 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Yesu pajajoa Yohana ampeliki mu kipungu, jajenda ku Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Jaboka ku Nazaleti, jajenda ku Kapelinaumu, musi gogubii pambipi nu nhanga uku Genesaleti, gogupakini nu nndema uku Zebuluni nuku Nafutali, jatama kokuje. <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Ndi latimia lilobi lejapwaaga Mlota waka Sapanga Isaya,<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>“Nndema guku Zebuluni nu nndema guku Nafutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">indela jukuyetuki ku nhanga mulutengu ja losi luku Yoludani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya, nndema wa bandu banga Ayaudi!<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Bandu baatama pa lwii agubweni unang'anu nkolongu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Nabombi baatama mundema ja lwii ni kihilu sa kuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">unang'anu gutei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">kwaanang'ani!”<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Tumbuka masoba gala Yesu jatumbuliya kulandi jakapwaga, “Nkotuka kuhenga mahakau, ndaba Ubambu ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga guhegali!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaakema aloi nsesi bumpwata</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maluko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Yesu pajabia jujenda mulutengu ju nhanga uku Galilaya, jaabona aka kilongu abeli aloi, Simoni jobunkema Petili nu nndongumundu Andilea. Babia bakalopula homba kwi ilepa mu nhanga ndaba babia aloi. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Mbwata nepani, na nepani nantenda mwanganya mbia mwa bandu babaleta bandu kwaka Sapanga.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Apalapa biileka ilepa yabu, nukunzengale.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Ejwabia jujenda palongi kidogu, jaabona aka kilongu abeli, Yakobu na Yohana bana baka Zebedayu. Haba babia nkati junhwatu pamu na ahengo babu Zebedayu, bakalenganakiya ilepa yabu. Ndi Yesu jatenda kwaakema, <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>nabombi apalapa buguleka nhwatu pamu na ahengo babu, nukunzengale.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaalamisa agonzu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Yesu jayongolatiya Galilaya joa, jatumbuliya kuboola mu nyumba yukuketangane Ayaudi, jaalandila bandu Lijambu la Amboni lu Ubambu ukolongu waka Sapanga. Jaalamisa bandu magonzu goa. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Majambu gaki gaeni pandu poti ku Silia. Ndienu bandu bumpelakiya agonzu boti, na bandu balwala ugonzu wokapi na baang'alika, baabii ni ilombu, bana kihinduhindu na bandu baalei, najombi jaalamisa boti. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Nsambi nkolongu wa bandu gwatenda kumpwata kuhuma ku Galilaya, nndema yuku Dekapoli maana jaki Misi Komi, Yelusalemu na Yudea na kwii ja losi luku Yoludani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaalandi bandu ku kitombi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Yesu pajugubona nsambi wa bandu, jakwela ku kitombi, nukutama pai. Banafunzi baki batenda kunzende, <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>najombi jatumbuliya kwaabola, koni jupwaga.<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutogule kwa sakaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>Apengaliwi bandu babunhobale Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">ndaba Ubambu ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga ndi gwabu. <verse eid="MAT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Apengiwi babii nu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">usungu mmoju ndaba jukutenda mahakau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">ndaba Sapanga jaakelubukiya kutogule kwabu.<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Apengiwi babunzogopa Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">ndaba biilisa ndema.<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Apengiwi baabii ni inzala na nywita jukuhenga gajagapala Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">ndaba biitenda kutupi.<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Apengiwi baabii ni ikia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">ndaba Sapanga jaabonila ikia.<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Apengiwi bana mwoju wa sapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">ndaba bammbona Sapanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Apengiwi baaleta lukwali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">ndaba baakema bana baka Sapanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Apengiwi baang'alika ndaba jukuhenga gajupala Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">ndaba Ubambu ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga ndi gwabo.<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>Mpengaliwi mwanganya bandu na buntondoo, nunkung'alisa nu kunkopake kwi isoli, ndaba mwanganya mbwata, <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Ntoguliya nukululuta ndaba nhupi inu ngolongu ibi ku maundi. Ndaba hela ndi ebaang'alisa alota baka Sapanga bababii kabula jukusaliwa mwanganya.<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwinyu nu unang'anu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maluko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>“Mwanganya ndi mwinyu gu pundema. Lakini mwinyu naguhoiki kunoga kwaki, boo, mwiibeka kii mbaka jinoga kabee? Ngasejibii ni lihengu kabee, ila aleke kunza nukukanyatwa na bandu.<verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>“Mwanganya ndi unang'anu wu nndema! Musi goasengiki panani ji kitombi ngaguwesi kuhihiika. <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Wala bandu ngaseapambaki taa nu kujiyekale ni kitonga, ila abeka panani ji kipanda ili gwamulakya boti baabii mu nyumba. <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Ahelahe, mwanganya unang'anu winu gunang'ana palongi ja bandu, ili bagabona mahengu ginu gaamboni ganhenga, ili baalumbaliya atati binu bu kunani kwaka Sapanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jubola Malagalaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>“Mwiholale hikiki kuputa malagalaki gaka Musa na mabolee gaka alota baka Sapanga. Ngasenhikiki kuputa ila kugatenda gabiya ga sakaka. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Numpwagi sakaka, mbaka kunani kwaka Sapanga nu nndema ekwipeta, nga hata nukuta jimu au lilobi lisokopi mu Malagalaki leliiboka, mbaka goti pagiitimia. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Ndienu jokapi jojiikana lilagisu lisokopi kuhuma ku Malagalaki gaanga, nakaabola bangi ahenga hela, mundu hoju jwiibia msoku ngani mu Ubambu ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga. Lakini jojukamulaki Malagalaki na kwaabola bangi ahenga hela, hoju jwibiya nkolongu mu Ubambu ukolongu ukunani kumaunde. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Numpwagi sakaka, ana ngasenhenga gajupala Sapanga kwaapeta abola ba Malagalaki na aka Afalisayu, kyee ngamwijingii mu Ubambu ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabolee gagakana kuba ni inyela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>“Nnzoini bandu ba mwandi baapwagila, ‘Wikoma na mundu jokapi jojikoma jupalika kutemuliwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Lakini nepani numpwagi sakaka, jokapi joanhyome ndongu waki, buntenda kuntemu. Mundu joantondo nndongu waki bampelika pasengu. Mundu joankema nndongu waki, ‘Nng'ang'a’ jubii pambipi kujingi mmwotu wanga kususuka masoba goa.” <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>“Ndienu, egupeleka matambiku gaku palongi ja mesa jukupiiki litambiku na papuje gukomboka gukomini nu nndongu waku, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>wagaleka hoti matambiku gaku palongi ja mesa jukupiiki litambiku, jenda hoti wakajomulania nu nndongu waku, ndi wikelubuka kupia litambiku laku.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>“Mundu na jugutaki, jongana na jojugutaki nyata mwindela kabula jukujenda pasengu, anangahela jojugutaki jagukabisa kwaka jojutemu, najombi ntemu jagukabisa kwaka nndonda, nanagu wikongika kukipungu. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Nugupwagi sakaka, ngawipiti mukipungu mola mbaka gwilepa lingengalema la mwisu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabolee gagakana ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>“Nnzoini bandu bumpwagila, ‘Mwitenda ugoni!’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Lakini nepani numpwagi, joandingali mmbomba nukuntokule, jutei naku ugoni mmoju jaki. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Ana ngati liu laku la malele lugukolo kuhenga mahakau, tupula ukalekala kutali. Nambanga kuhoa kipandi simu sa nhyega jaku, kuliku nhyega jaku joti kuleke mmwotu wa masoba goa. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Anangati kuboku kwaku kwa malele gukukolo kuhenga mahakau, sekula wakalekala kutali. Nambanga kuhoa kipandi simu sa nhyega jaku, kuliku nhyega jaku joti kuguleke mmwotu wa masoba goa.”<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabole gukukana kutalikana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matei 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maluko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>“Apwagiki kabee, ‘Joandeka nhanu waki, kupalika ampekiya likalatasi lu kutalikana.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Lakini nepani numpwagi, mundu jokapi joantalika nhwanu waki, ila pee ndaba jutei ugoni, ankolo jutenda ugoni, na mundu jokapi anajujukwi mmbomba joantaliki, najombi kabee jutenda ugoni.”<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabole gagakana kulapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>“Kabee nzoini bandu ba mwandi ebaapwagila, ‘Wikotoka kutenda sewalagila kutenda, ila gutimisa kulagi kwaku kwa Bambu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Lakini nepani numpwagi, mwilapa, wala su kunani kwaka Sapanga, ndaba senyesi ndi kiteu su ubambu saka Sapanga, <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>wala kulilapi kwa nndema, ndaba paniapa ndi pandu pukubeke magolu gaki, wala ku Yelusalemu, ndaba goniogu ndi musi waka Bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Wala wilapa su umutu waku, ndaba ngaseguwesa kuling'anambu lijunzu limu kuba lihuu au lijilu. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Anagupwagiki, ‘Hena,’ kubia, ‘Hena,’ na gupwagiki, ‘Ngahela,’ kubia, ‘Ngahela.’ Sokapi sekijonzuke haga kihuma kuku Mbaja jola.”<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabolee gagakana kulepesa ubaja</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>“Nzoini ebapwaaga, ‘Lihu kwa lihu na linu kwa linu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Lakini nepani numpwagi, gwandepa sindu silia mundu mbaja. Mundu ana jugulapwi likopi lituku luku malele, kabee gundeka jugulapula lituku luku mangega, <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Mundu ana jukutaki ili kugujukuki likoti laku, gundeka jujukua na kaputi jaku. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Mundu anajupala untotuliya nsigu waki kilumita jimu, witotula kilumita ibeli. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Gumpekiya jojuguloba, na jojuguloba wannzima.”<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwaapala babugusuki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>“Nnzoini ebapwaaga, ‘Gumpala nnzako na gunsukila jojugusuki.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Lakini nepani numpwagi, mwaapala banga kumpala na kwaalobe kwaka Sapanga babunng'alisa mwanganya, <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>ili mbia mwabana ba Atati binu baabii kunani ku mahundi. Ndaba lyoba laki laanang'ani bandu abaya na baamboni, na kwaakuni iyula bandu baabi abaya na baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Ana mwaapai babumpai pee, boo, mwiipata nhupi bole? Ndaba baajopa kodi nabombi ahenga ahelahela! <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Ana mwaalamuki alongu bii pena, boo ntenda sindu boo sakwaapea bandu bange? Hata bandu banga kummanya Sapanga, ahenga ahelahela. <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Henu, mbia momkamiliki, ngati Atati binu bu kunani kwaka Sapanga ebii akamiliki.”<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Kwaajangati ahagu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>“Nnzepa kuhenga mahengu gaamboni palongi ja bandu ili mbonikana. Ndaba anantei hela ngamwiipati nhupi jokapi kuhuma kwa Atati binu bu kunani kwaka Sapanga.<verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>“Henu, hemunzangati mundu nhagu sindu sokapi, walilangii kwa bandu. Wiihenga ngati bandu babilikopake baamboni, heahenga mu manyumba gukuketangane Ayaudi na mwiindela ili bandu baalumbaliya. Numpwagi sakaka, baniaba apatiki nhupi yabu yoti. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Lakini wehapa egunzangati nhagu, henga kinunu hata nkosi waku jwimanya seguhenga. <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>Waajangatya ahagu kinunukinunu, na Atati baku babagabona gaguhenga mukinunu, bagupekiya nhupi.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabole gukundoba Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>“Pamundoba Sapanga, mwihenga ngati babilikopake baamboni. Ndaba bombi apala kujema kundoba Sapanga mu manyumba gukuketangane Ayaudi na mumagobukanu giindeela ili bandu baabona. Numpwagi sakaka, haba apatiki nhupi yabu yoti. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Lakini wehapa pagundoba Sapanga, jingala nsumba saku, jigala ndyangu waku, ndi waaloba Atati baku banga kubonikana. Ndienu Atati baku babagabona gauhenga sujobu bagupekiya nhupi.<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>“Pamundoba Sapanga, mwiposukana malobi gingi ganga na mana ngati ehenga bandu banga kummanya Sapanga. Ndaba bombi awasali baajogwaniya ndaba ja malobi gabu kuba gingi. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Mwikuba ngati bombi, ndaba Atati binu amamyiki gampala kabula ngasemwalobiki. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Lakini mwanganya nndoba ana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Atati bitu mombii kunani kwaka Sapanga kwaka Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">liina linu lilumbalika ngani.<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Ubambu ukolongu waku guhika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">gagupala gahengika pundema ngati kunani kwaka Sapanga kwaka Sapanga.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Gutupekiya lelenu posu jitu ja kila lisoba,<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Gutulekakiya mahakau gitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">ngati twepani etwalekake babutukosi.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Watujingisa mu milengu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">lakini utuhokua kuhuma kuku Mbaja jola.’<verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>“Namwalekaki bangi babunhengi giliya, Atati bii bu kunani kabee bandekakya na mwanganya giliya gamwahengi bangi. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Lakini nanga kwaalekake bandu bangi, Atati binu bu kunani ngabandekake mahakau gino.<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabolee guku punga kula posu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>“Pampunga kula posu, mwiikuba nhyomiki ngati bandu baakopake baamboni heatenda. Bombi atulana pamihu jabu ili abonikana kwa bandu atei kupunga kula posu. Numpwagi sakaka, haba apatiki hupi yabu. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Lakini pagupunga kula posu, gusamba pamihu jaku, gupakia mahuta kumutu jaku, <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>ili wiimanyikana kwa bandu gutei kupunga kula, ila amanya Atati baku banga kubonikana pee. Nabombi Atati baku babagabona gagilihihiki, jampekia nhupi.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubeka kikoku kunani kwaka Sapanga kwaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:33">Luka 12:33</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:34">34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>“Mwalibeke kikoku pundema, momuje nkeki na kutu itenda kuhalabana na bii atenda kubombo nuku kujiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Lakini mlibekila mali kunani kwaka Sapanga, kokuje ibongo na kutu ngaseiwesia, kuhalabana hata bii ngaawesi kutunu nu kujingi kujiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Ndaba pagabi mali gaku ndi pagubii moju waku.”<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lihu ndi unang'anu wa nhyega</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>Lihu ndi unang'anu wa nhyega. Ana lihu laku libi sapi, nhyega jaku joti jibii pu unang'anu. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Lakini ana lihu laku libohu, nhyega jaku joti jiibya mu lwii. Lakini, ana unang'anu gogubii nkati jaku gubii na lwii, ndienu lwibiya lwii tikitiki!<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu jwana mali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>Nga mundu jojuwesa kwaatumaki akakolongu abeli, ndaba ansukila jumu nukumpala jongi, au jijongana na jumu kundongama jongi. Ngakuwesa kuntumaki Sapanga napapa nukutumaki mali.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>“Henu numpwagi, mwihangajaki posu wala sa kunywa ili nhwesa kutama, wala ingobu yempalika kuwata mu nhyega inu. Boo, womi lee ngasindu kikolongu kupeta poso? Na nhyega boo, nga lee sindu kikolongu kupeta ingobo? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Mwilingaliya ijuni yu nnani, yombi ngaseipanda wala kuhusa wala kubeka sokapi mwikikoku, lakini Atati binu bu kunani biilea. Boo, mwanganya lee ngase mpalika kujangatiwa ngani kupeta ijune? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Nyaa kati jinu kukulihangajisa kwaki juwesa kujonzuke ulasu wa womi wake hata kwilisaa limo?<verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>“Ndaba jakii nhangajaki ingobo? Nndingaliya maua gimwikiholi egakola. Ngasegahenga lihengu wala kulilenganake ingobu. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Lakini numpwagi, hata Bambu Solomoni na hindu yaki hingi yoti, ngasebawahiki kunhwatika ngati maua haga. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Henu ana Sapanga jagawatika maua libi lelenu ni kilabu bagaleke pamwotu, boo Sapanga ngajanhwatiki mwanganya nakanope? Mwanganya mombii nukuhobale kusokopi!<verse eid="MAT 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>“Henu, mwiihangajaki kupwaaga, ‘Twiikula kii au twiikunywa kike? Au twiiwata kiki!’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Ndaba haga goti bagahangajaki bandu banga kumanya Sapanga. Atati binu bu kunani kwaka Sapanga amanyiki mpala hindu heyi yote. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Lakini ntaputa oti Ukolongu waka Sapanga, nu nnhenga goti gajupala Sapanga, na gangi haga goti jiitenda kunzonzuke. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Henu mwihangajaki gi kilabu, ndaba gi kilabu galihangajakiya geni. Matatisu gilisoba limu gatosane kulisoba heli.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Kwaatemu bandu bangi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka 6:37-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>“Mwaatemu bandu bangi, ili nanamu mwiitemuliwa na Sapanga, <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Ndaba emwatemu bandu bangi, ndi nanamu ebantemula. Kipemu aselase sentumii kwa kwaatemu bandu bangi ndi Sapanga sejwitumia kuntemu mwanganya. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Ndaba jakii ukibona kijola sekibii mmihu jaka nndongu waku, na papa ngakulubona lumbagau lolubii nndiu jako? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Guwesa boo kumpwagi nndongu waku, ‘Nndongu wango, lekaoti nuguboi kijola sekibii nndiu jaku,’ koni wamweti gubii nulumbagau nndiu jako? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Weapa ulikopake waamboni! Guboa oti lumbagau lolubii nndiu jaku ndi wiwesa kukibona sapi kijola sekibi kukunndongu waku.”<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>Mwaipeke himbwa hindu ya sapi ndaba yaa nng'anambuka nukuntukali nukunduma. Mwagalekale magolobi mayuda gii ndaba biitenda kukanyatakanyata kwa magolu gabu.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nndoba, ntaputa nhotima</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>“Nndoba nanamu biitenda kumpeke, ntaputa nanamu mwitenda kupata, nhotima nanamu biitenda kunhogule. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Ndaba, mundu jokapi jojuloba atenda kumpeke na jojutaputa jutenda kupata na jojuhotima atenda kunhogule nndyangu. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Atati boo, kati jinu mwana waki ana andobiki libumunda ampekia lilibo? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Au anajulobiiki homba, ampekia lijoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Ana mwanganya mwabaya mmanya kwaapeke bana bii nhupi ya sapi, boo Atati bii bu kunani ngalee biijonzuke kaapeke hindu ya sapi babunndoba?<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>“Goti gampala bandu banhengila mwanganya, mwaatendila bombii ahelahela, ndaba Malagalaki gaka Musa na mabole ga Alota gapwaaga ahelahe.<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nndyangu mpepandau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>“Nnzingala kupete nndiyangu mpepandau. Ndaba indela jejilongoo ku kuwa ndi ngolongu na bandu baapeta indela heji bingipi. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Lakini indela jejilongoo kuwomi nzoku nu ndyangu ukujingali mpepandau na bandu babijibona indela heji asokope.”<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nkongu na matunda gaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka 6:43-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>“Nnzepana na alota biisoli. Babunhiki kunza abonikana makondoo, lakini nkati abonikana imei ikali. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Mwaamanya kwa mahengu gabo. Boo bandu lee atongo matunda mizabibu mu mikongu ja miha, au atongo lee tini mumbigile? <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Nala nkongu wa sapi gutenda kupapa matunda gasapi nu nkongu gwilyaa gupapa matunda giliya. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Nkongu wa sapi ngase gupapa matunda giliya nu nkongu gwiliya ngase gupapa matunda gaa sape. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Kila nkongu gwanga kupapa matunda gaa sapi aguseku nukuguleke pamwotu. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Henu mwaamanya alota biisoli kwa mahengu gabu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngasenummanyi mwanganya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>“Nga kila jojungema, ‘Bambu, Bambu’ jwijingala mu Ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga, ila jojuhenga gaapala Atati bangu babii kunani kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Mlisoba le lela bandu bingi biimbwagila, ‘Bambu, Bambu! Kwiliina laku twaalandila bandu lilobi laka Sapanga nu kwiliina laku twaapia bandu ilombu nu kwiliina laku tuhengika nginyuli hingi.’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Ndienu naapwagila, ‘Kye ngasenummanyiki mwanganya. Mmbokaniya palongi jangu moutenda mahakau!’<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baasenga abeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>“Henu, kila mundu jojujoana malobi gangu nu kugahenga, julengana na mundu jwana malangu, jojusengiki nyumba jaki panani ji lilibu likolongu. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Iyula jatenda kukuna, losi yatenda kutwele kikoka, kimbonga satenda kupoga nukujikanga nyumba heji. Lakini nyumba heji ngasejahabwiki ndaba nsingi waki basengiki nkati jililibu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>“Lakini mundu jokapi jojujoana malobi gangu na ngase juhenge lihengu, julengana na mundu nng'anga, jojusengiki nyumba jaki panani ju nsangi. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Iyula jatenda kukuna, losi yatenda kutwele kikoka, nhwai watenda kupoga nukujikanga nyumba jela, najombi jabombuka nukuhabuka joka.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ukolongu waka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Yesu ejajomula kupwaaga malobi haga, nsambi wa bandu gogunnzoannya gwasangii ngamaa mabole gaki. <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>Ndaba jabola ngati mundu junu uwesu nkolongu, nga ngati aka abola babu ba malagalaki.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamisa mundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maluko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Yesu ejahuluka ku kitombi, nsambi nkolongu wa bandu watenda kumpwata. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Mundu jumu jojuleliki anzendila, anzinamia nukupwaga, “Bambu, ana gupai guwesa kunyambisa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Yesu jwanyosha kuboku kwaki angusa mundu jojuleliki jola nukumpwagi, “Mbala gunyambisika.” Apalapa mundu jola jatenda kulama. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Ndipala Yesu ampwagila mundu jola, “Jowania, wampwagi mundu jokapi, ila gujenda ukulilangia kwaka nngolu nkolongu na ukapia litambiku lejalagalakiya Musa, kwaalangi bandu gulamiki.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhobale kwaka nkolongu jumu juku Loma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Yesu pajabia jujingii ku Kapelinaumu, nkolongu jumu jwa alonda juku Loma anzendila, nukunndoba anzangatia, <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>ampwagila, “Bambu, mtumi wangu jugoni kunyumba, nngonzu jukulela nhyega kabee julwala ngamaa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Niijenda kundamisa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Lakini nkolongu jola ampwagila, “Bambu, nepani ngase kupalika wehapa gujingila mu nyumba jango. Lakini pwaga lilobi pee, nu ntumi wangu jwiitenda kulama.” <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>“Ndaba, hata ngama nepani anongo akolongu bangi kabee mi na alonda banaalongo. Nunndagalaki ajojo, ‘Jenda’ najombi jutenda kujenda, nunndagalaki jongi, ‘Hikaa’ najombi jutenda kuhika. Kabee ana nunndagalaki ntumwa wangu, ‘Henga ase’ najombi jutenda kuhenga.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Yesu ejajoana malobi gala, jatenda kusanga, jaapwagila bandu babumpwatiki, “Numpwaagi sakaka, ngase nhwaiki kumbona mundu jokapi pa Izilaeli pani jojuhobale ngati ajo. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Numpwaagi sakaka, bandu bingi bihika kuhuma ku kolipita lioba nu kolihobe lioba, nabombi biitama pa tipati gakula posu pamu na Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobu mu Ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Lakini bandu baapalika kuba mu ubambu ukolongu waka Sapanga, mitibaalekala kunza, kolubii lwii, kokuje biibiya alela nukupola minu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Ndipala Yesu ampwagila nkolongu jola, “Jenda kunyumba na gaguhobali haga giitenda kuhengeka.” Nu ntumi jola jatenda kulama muda agolagola.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jalamisa bandu bingi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maluko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Yesu ejajingala mu nyumba jaka Petili, jaakolila akowanu baka Petili agoni pikitanda abii na homa. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Ndienu, Yesu angusa nyongoo jola kuboku, na homa jela jatenda kukotoka, jatumbuliya kuntumaki Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Ekwabiya pakamii, bandu bundetila Yesu bandu bingi bababii niilombu, Yesu jaaboa ilombu sukupwaga pee lilobi, ndi jaalamisa bandu boka bababi agonzu boti. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Jahenga hela ili gatimia gajaapwaga mlota jwaka Sapanga Isaya, “Jombi mweni jujukwi mang'aliku gitu kabee jutotwi magonzu gitu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eapalika kuba banafunzi baka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Yesu ejugubona nsambi wa bandu gunhyongaliti, jaapwagila banafunzi baki ajenda kwii ju nhanga. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Mmbola jumu jwa Malagalaki anzendila Yesu, ampwagila, “Mmbola, nepani nagupwata kwokapi kola kowijenda.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Yesu jajibua, “Mabwea gabii na mapoli gabu, ni ijuni yukunani ibii ni miui jabu, lakini mwana waka Mundu nga na pandu puku pomulalela.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Mbolee waki jumu ampwagila, “Bambu, nyetakaliya nyenda kunyumba nakaataga atati bangu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Lakini Yesu ampwagila, “Mbwata! Waaleka baawii baataga baawii ajabu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jagalakali majeba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maluko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Yesu pajajingala munhwatu banafunzi baki batenda kumpwata. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Apalapa, gapitila majeba makolongu munhanga na masi gatumbuliya kuguyekale nhwatu. Lakini Yesu jabiya jugosi lugonu. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Banafunzi baki bunzendila, bunzumua nukupwaaga, “Bambu, utuokuaje tutenda kuwa!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Lakini Yesu jwaapwagila, “Mwabandu bini lihobale lisokopi mwanganya, ndaba jaki ntenda kujogopa?” Ndienu, jajumuka jagalakaliya majeba makolongu gala nu nhanga gola gwatuli nuu.<verse eid="MAT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Banafunzi baki basangi nukupwaga, “Jonioju we mundu bole? Hata unhwai na majeba gatenda kunzoanela!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaalamisa bandu abeli bini ilombu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maluko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Yesu ejahika kwii ju nhanga, munndema wa Agadala, jwaketangana na bandu abeli baabii ni ilombu bakahumila kutenge. Bandu haba babiya ajogoo ngamaa, nga mundu jojalenga kupeta indela jela. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Apalapa batenda kujamalii, “Gupala kike kwito, wehapa wa Mwana waka Sapanga? Guhikiki pamba kutung'alisa kabula ji lisoba litu kuhika?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Pambipi na pandu pehapa kwabii na magolobi gingi gakakula. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Ilombu yela yundoba Yesu, “Anautubenga, nambanga utujetakiya tugajingala magolobi galaga.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Jaapwagila, “Hena mmbokaniya.” Ndienu yaapiita bandu bala, nu kujingii mwamagolobi, na magolobi ge gatilila pilikemba luku nhanga nukujingi mu nhanga, na goti gakuwa mmasi.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Alimu ba magolobi bala batilila ku musi. Hoku baalandila bandu kila sindu sesapitila na gagaapitila bandu bababii ni ilombu. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Bandu boti ba musi we gola bunzendila Yesu, pabumbona bundoba juboka mu nndema wabu.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamisa mundu jojulei</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maluko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Yesu jwajingala mu nhwatu, jalombuka nhanga, nukuhika mmusi waki. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Bandu bangi bundetila mundu jojulei, babia angoniki pu mpandu. Yesu ejukubona kuhobale kwabu, ampwagila mundu jojulei jola, “Mwanango, hobaliyaje, mahakau gaku galekakiwi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Abola bangi ba Malagalaki bapwaga mu mioju jabu, “Mundu hajo antondo Sapanga!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Yesu jagamanyiki mawasu gabu, jalalukiya, “Ndaba jakii nhwasali ubaja mu mioju jino? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Laa lelipepwiki ngani, kupwaga, ‘Gulekakiwi mahakau gaku,’ au kupwaaga, ‘Jema gujendaje?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Lakini, nepani mbala mmanya Mwana waka Mundu jubii nu uwesu wakalekake bandu mahakau.” Ndienu ampwagila mundu jojulei jola, “Jukua mpandu waku gujenda.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Mundu jola jajema nukujenda kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Bandu pababona gala, batenda kujogopa, bundumbaliya Sapanga jojaapeki bandu uwesu wehogu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankema Matei</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maluko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Yesu pajaboka pala, ambona mundu jumu jobunkema Matei jutemi mu nyumba jukulepe kodi. Ampwagila, “Mbwata.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Matei jajema nukumpwata.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Yesu pajabia jutemi kula posu ja pakamii mu nyumba jaka Matei, baajopa kodi bingi na baabii na mahakau bahika kula pamu najombi na banafunzi baki. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Afalisayu ebagabona haga, baalalukiya banafunzi baki, “Mbona mmbola winu jukula pamu na baajopa kodi na bana mahakao?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Yesu pajwajoana haga, japwaaga, “Bandu babii bomi ngaseampala aka singanga ila baalwala ndi baapala aka singanga. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Nzendaniya mukilibola maana ja Maandiku gaka Sapanga gaga pwaga, ‘Mbala ikia wala nga matambiku.’ Ndaba ngasenahika kwaakema bandu baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga ila bandu bana mahakau.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabolee guku punga kula posu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maluko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Ndipala banafunzi baka Yohana Mmbatisa bunzendila Yesu, nukundaluki, “Mbona twepani na Afalisayu tupunga kula posu lakini banafunzi baku ngaseapunga kula posu?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Yesu jajibua, “Boo kuwesikana lee bandu babaakokiki ku ndoa kupunga kula posu koni bambu wa ndoa jubii pamu nabo?” Ngahela, ngasekuwesikana! Liihika lisoba bambu ndoa bamboa kwabu, lisoba leheli ndi pabipunga kula posu.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>“Mundu ngasejuseku kibambu si ingobu inyai nukusone mwiingobu jejilaile. Ana jutei hela, ingobu inyai jela jiijendula ingobu jejilai jela, na papajendwiki jepala piitenda kujonzukeka.<figure style="fig" alt="New patch" file="11 Unshrunk Patch.jpg" size="col" ref="9:16">Kibambu kinyai</figure> <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Kabee nga mundu jojujege divai inyai mumipuku ja ngosi ja mwandi, ana jutei hela, mipuko jela jiitenda kupojoka na divai inyai jela jiitenda kujitika ni mipuku ja ngosi jitenda kuhalabika. Ila bandu abeka divai inyai mu mipuku minyai, na yoti ibeli yiibia abei pandu pa sapi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kamwali jojuwii na nyongoo jumu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:21-23">Maluko 5:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Yesu pajabiya jupwaga haga, kilongosi jumu Nhyahudi jwahika, anzinamiya nukupwaga, “Kamwali wangu juwii hesajeno, lakini gupepa koku, guhika kumbeke kuboku ili julama.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Yesu jajumuka nukumpwata na banafunzi baki batenda kupwata.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Mmbomba jumu jojuwe jabi nuugonzu ukujauka ku kipindi sa yaka komi ni ibeli, jahika munyuma jaka Yesu angusa lupeta lwi ingobu yaki. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Jilipwagila mmoju jaki, “Anangamwi pe ingobu yaki niitenda, kulama.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Yesu ejang'anumbuka jwatenda kummbona ampwagila, “Kamwali wangu ulikasa mwoju! Kuhobale kwaku kugulamise.” Apalapa mbomba wejola jatenda kulama.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Ndipala Yesu jajingala mu nyumba jaka kilongosi jola. Na ejaabona bandu ajemba mapenenga na bandu bingi atenda kulobalake, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>jaapwagila, “Mpitaniya kunza! Kamwali jonzo ngasejakuhike, ila jutei kugone pena.” Lakini bombi batenda kunheka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Lakini bandu pababiya baapiiki kunza, Yesu jajingala nkati ankamula kuboku kamwali jola, apalapa najombi jatenda kujema. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Lijambu leheli laeniya nndema woti.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaalamisa bangalinga abele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Yesu pajaboka pala, hejwabia mwiindela bangalinga abeli bunkagula koni bakajamaliya kwa makili, “Mwana waka Daudi, utubonila ikia.”<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Yesu ejajingala nkati, bangalinga abeli bala bunzendila, najombi jaalalukiya, “Boo, nnhobale lee nepani nhwesa kundamisa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Nabombi bajibua, “Ena Bambu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Papuje Yesu jagusa mihu gabu, nukupwaga, “Kubia kwinu ngati enhobali.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Mihu gabu gatenda kulinga. Najombi Yesu jaakanakia suukali, “Mwampwagi mundu jokapi lijambu leheli.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Lakini bombi ebaboka, balandila majambu gaka Yesu pa ndema jela.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamisa kimumuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Pababiya atenda kuboka, bandu bundetila Yesu kimumuta, jojabii ni ilombu. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Apalapa kilombu sela pasaboka, mundu jojabii kimumuta jola jatumbuliya kulonge. Bandu basangia nukupwaaga, “Lijambu ngati ale ngaseliwaiki kupitii pa Izilaeli!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Lakini Afalisayu bapwaaga, “Nkolongu jwi ilombu ndi joampeke Yesu makili gukuboa ilombu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaabonee bandu ikia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Yesu jayongolota mmisi joti ni ijiji yoti koni jakabola mu nyumba yukuketangane Ayaudi gabu nukulandi Majambu ga Sapi gu Ubambu Ukolongu waka Sapanga, nakalamisa bandu kila magonzu nukung'alika kwoti. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Yesu pajugubona nsambi wa bandu, jaabonila ikia ndaba babiya asokiki na abii ni kiholu, na babiya abaganyiki ngati makondoo ganga nu nndimi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Papuje jaapwagila banafunzi baki, “Ilebii yukuhusa ibii hingipi lakini baahenga lihengu lukuhusa be asokopi. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Ndienu mundoba Bambu jojuhusa, jaaleta bahenga lihengu mlitui laki.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Atumi komi na abeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maluko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Yesu jaakemaa pamu banafunzi baki komi na abeli, jaapekiya uwesu gukupia ilombu nuku lamisa magonzu na mang'alisu goka. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Mahina ga atumi haba ganga: jutumbuli Simoni jobunkemika Petili nundonguwaki Andilea na Yakobu nu ndongu waki Yohana bana baka Zebedayu. <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Pilipi na Batolomayu na Tomasi na Matei jojabii jojujopa kodi na Yakobu mwana waka Alufayo na Tadei, <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Simoni jojukomane nndema waki na Yuda Isikalioti joang'anumbuka Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaatuma atumi komi na abeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maluko 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Yesu jaatumaa atumi komi na abeli haba, jaapekia uwesu nakaalagalaki, “Mwijenda kwa bandu banga Ayaudi, wala mwijingi mmisi ya Asamalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Ila nzendannya kwa bandu buku Izilaeli baobiki ngati makondoo gagahobiki. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Enzenda, mkalandila ana, ‘Ubambu ukolongu waka Sapanga guegali.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Mwalamisa agonzu, mwaayoa baawii na mwaanyambisa baaleliki, mwakapia ilombu. Mpatiki bwaka mwakaboa bwaka. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Mwiitoto zaabu mumipuku jinu wala feza, wala lingengalema la shaba. <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>Mwitoto nkoba wa sapwali mwiindela, wala majalisi mabeli wala makobasi mabeli wala ndonga. Ndaba jojuhenga lihengu jwiipata gajupala kila lisoba.”<verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>“Emwakajingala ku musi au kijiji sokapi mukuntaputa mundu jwaamboni jojupai kunzopa, mwakatama pala mbaka pamwiboka. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Emwakajingala mu nyumba mwakalamukiya bandu babii nyumba mola, ‘Lukwali lubia na mwanganya.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Ana bandu ba nyumba bunzopiki, ndienu lukwali lwinu lwibiya pamu nabombi. Lakini anangasebunzopiki, ndienu lukwali lukunkelabukia mwabee. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Ana mundu jokapi jwiikana kunzopa au kunzoane malobi ginu, emwakaboka mu nyumba jeheji au musi wehogu, mwakakung'unda luhombi mu magolu kulangi akaniki kunzopa. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Numpwaagi sakaka, lisoba lu kutemu bandu bamusi hogu biitemuliwa ngani kupeta bandu buku musi uku Sodoma na Gomola.<verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mang'alisu ga banafunzi gagahika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maluko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>“Nnzoaniya, nepani nuntuma mwanganya ngati makondoo pikilanda ji imei. Henu mmbia na malangu ngati lijoka, na mmbia mwaapoli ngati ngunda. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Nzepana na bandu, ndaba bampelika mwanganya ku sengu, nukunndapu iboku munyumba yabu yukuketangane Ayaudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Bampelika palongi ja aka kilongosi na aka bambu akolongu ndaba jangu nepani, nndandila Lijambu la Amboni kwabu na kwa bandu banga Ayaudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Lakini pabankamula mwanganya, mwihangajika kuwasali gamwiipwaga, ndaba mwipata sukupwaga muda gogo. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Ndaba nga mwanganya mo mwibia mwakalongila ila Loho ja Atati binu biipwaga kupete mwanganya.<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>“Mundu ang'anumbuka nndongu waki ili jukomika, na atati banng'anumbuka mwanamundu, nabombi bana bahang'anambuka atati na amabu babu na kaakoma. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Bandu boti bansukila mwanganya ndaba jukunhobale nepani. Lakini jojihinakaliya mbaka pa mwisu, ndi jojikombulika. <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Pabanng'alisa mmusi gumu, mwitilila mmusi gongi. Numpwagi sakaka, ngamwijomo lihengu lii mmisi joti juku Izilaeli kabula Mwana waka Mundu kuhika.<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>“Mmbolee ngasejuwesa kumpeta mmbola waki wala mtumisi ngase juwesa kumpeta bambu waki. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Lakini tosa mmbolee kuba ngati mmbola waki, nu mtumisi kuba ngati bambu waki. Ila anabunkemiki nkolongu jwa nyumba Belizebuli, boo, bandu baatama mu nyumba mola nga bunkemi mahina giliya ngane?<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jojupalika kunzogopa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>“Ndienu, mwaajogopa bandu. Kila sindu sekiyekaliki sitenda kuyekulika, na kila sekihikiki sitenda kubonikana. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Lenumpwagi mwanganya mulwii, mlipwaaga pu unang'anu ni lijambu lemwilijoini alonge suku bolane, mwililandila pangwendu. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Mwaajogopa babijikoma nhyega, lakini ngaseawesa kujikoma loho. Nambanga kunzogopa jojuwesa kualabana nhyega pamu na loho mu mwotu wanga kususuka masoba goha. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Boo, hiweba ibeli lee ngasealomba kwa mangengalema mabeli masoku? Lakini nga hata jumu wabu jojukuwa bila Atati binu kupala. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Hata majunzu gagabii ku imutu yii gabalangiki. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Henu mwijogopa, ndaba mwanganya Sapanga ampala ngani kupeta ijuni yoti.<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kunzetake nu kunkana Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>“Kila mundu jojunyetake nepani palongi ja bandu, kabee nanzetakiya palongi ja Atati bangu baabii kunani kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Lakini mundu jokapi jojingana palongi ja bandu, nanepani nankana palongi ja Atati bangu baabii kunani kwaka Sapanga.<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubaganika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>“Mwiwasali nepani nhikiki kwahenga bandu atama nulukwali pundema. Ngahela, ngasenhikiki kuleta lukwali ila ngondu. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Ndaba nhikiki kukomanisa kati jaka mundu na atati mundu na kamwali na amabu baki na kati ja anhyalamundu na akowanu baki. <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>Nu mbaja waka mundu ndi bandu buku nyumba jaki.<verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>“Jokapi jojapai atati na amabu baki kuliku ejumbala nepani, ngasejupalika kuba mbolee wango. Na jokapi joampai mwana waki au kamwali waki kuliku ejumbai nepani, ngasejupalika kuba mbolee wango. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Mundu jwanga kujuku nsalaba waki nukumbwata, ngasejupalika kuba mbolee wango. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Jojukamulaki womi waki ndaba jukunhobale nepani jitenda kuguhoa, lakini jojuhoa womi waki ndaba jangu nepani, jiipata kabee.<verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhupi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maluko 9:41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>“Jojunzopa mwanganya, junyopa nepani, na jojunyopa nepani anzopa jojundumike. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Joanzopa mlota waka Sapanga ndaba mlota waka Sapanga, hoju jijopa nhupi yuku mlota waka Sapanga. Joanzopa mundu jwa amboni palongi jaka Sapanga, jijopa nhupi yaka mundu jwa amboni. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Numpwagi sakaka, jokapi joampeke jumu jwa apwasi bangu banga kumanyikana, kikombi sa masi mahimu ndaba ja kuba mmbolee jwangu, hoju jiipata nhupi jaki.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohana Mmbatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Yesu ejajomula kaapeke lilagisu banafunzi komi na abeli, jaboka pala nukujenda kubola nu kulandi bandu na bapambipi na misi juku Galilaya.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Yohana Mmbatisa pajabii mligelesa jwajogwana gajuhenga Yesu Kilisitu. Ndienu, Yohana jaatuma banafunzi baki, <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>bukundalukiya, “Boo, wehapa le jojapwaga Yohana gutenda kuhika, au tundendaliya jonge?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Nnzendannya mkumpwagila Yohana majambu gamwagajoana nakagabona, <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>bangalinga atenda kulinga, ilema bamagolu atenda kujenda na baaleliki atenda kunyambisika na banga kujoa atenda kujowa na baawii atenda kuyoka na ahagu baalandi Lijambu la Amboni. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Jupengaliwi mundu jangakukotoka kunhobale nepani.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Ndienu, banafunzi baka Yohana pababiya ajendane, Yesu jatumbuliya kugupwagi nsambi wa bandu lijambu laka Yohana ana, “Pamwajenda kulukoba kola mwajenda kulinga kike? Boo, mwajenda kulinga nndai lolupoga nunhwae? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Henu, mwajenda kulinga kike? Mwajenda lee kundinga mundu jojuwati ingobu yeinyambike? Bandu bawata ingobu yeinyambiki atama mu manyumba gu ubambu nkolongu. <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Lakini, mwajenda kulinga kyane? Kumbona mlota waka Sapanga? Ena, numpwagi mumbona mundu nkolongu kupeta mlota waka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>Hajo ndi joandongale mu Maandiku gaka Sapanga, ‘Linga, nepani numtuma ntenga wangu jugulonguliya, jojuwe jwaguhandaliya indela jaku.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Numpwagi sakaka, kati ja bandu boti baasaliwi kwaka mbomba, ngasejupitii jojubii nkolongu kupeta Yohana Mmbatisa. Kabee, jojubii nsoku mu ubambu ukolongu ukumaundi, ndi nkolongu kupeta jombi. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Tumbuka masoba gaka Yohana Mmbatisa mbaka sajenu, ubambu ukolongu agupenga ngamaa na bandu bana makili ndi babugujuku. <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Malagalaki gaka Musa na alota baka Sapanga balongaliya lijambu luukolongu waka Sapanga mbaka masoba gaka Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>Ana mugahobale haga, nala Yohana ndi Elia jobundongaliyaje jwiitenda kuhika. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Jwana makutu guku jowane jujoana!<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>“Henu ni kilenganisa kibeleku ase na sindu bole? Kilengana na akombu baatama pulubanza, baakema bangi nakaapwagi, <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>‘Tunzembi mapenenga, lakini ngase mwahinike! Tunzembi mihambu ji kilelu, lakini ngasemwaleile!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Ndaba Yohana Mmbatisa jahika, jupunga kula wala ngasejukunywika divai nabombi bapwaaga, ‘Jubii ni ilombu.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Mwana waka Mundu juhikiki, jukula na kunywa, nabombi bapwaaga, ‘Mundingaliya mundu hajo, nndepi nu nndapi, nkosi wa bandu baajopa kodi na bana mahakau!’ Lakini malangu gaka Sapanga jiibonikana ja sapi kupete mahengu gaki.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu ba Misi janga kuobale</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Ndipala Yesu jatumbuliya kwaalakali bandu ba misi ye jwahengiki ndonduke yingi ndaba ngasebalekaki mahakau gabu. <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>“Misi mukiboni mwabandu buku Kolazini! Misi mukiboni mwa bandu buku Betisaida! Ana nginyuli yehengika kwinu yakahengika ku misi yuku Tilo nuku Sidoni, bandu baahoku bakabiya akotwiki mahakau toka mwandi nu kuwata magunii nukulipaki ilihu. <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Lakini numpwagi, biiwesa kuhinakali mu masoba gukutemu bandu buku Tilo na buku Sidoni kupeta mwanganya. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Mwabandu buku Kapelinaumu! Boo, mwalikwea mbaka kunani kumaunde? Banhulua mbaka kumwotu wanga kususuka koatama bandu baawii! Ndaba, ana ndonduke yeihengiki kwinu mwanganya yakahengika ku Sodoma, musi wehogu wakabiya mbaka leleno. <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Lakini numpwagi, lisoba lu kutemu Sapanga jaabonila ikia bandu buku Sodoma kupeta mwanganya.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhika kwaminepani mpomuliyaje</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Kipindi sehesi Yesu japwaaga, “Nunsengu mwa Atati, Bambu jukunani kwaka Sapanga nu nndema, ndaba waahihiki majambu haga bana malangu na baasomiki, waayekuli bandu asoku.” <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Ena, Atati bangu, hela ndi ekukukulengani.<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>“Atati bangu ambeki indu yoti. Nga jojaamanyi Mwana ila Atati. Ngamundu jojaamanyi Atati ila Mwana na mundu jokapi jojupala Mwana anhyekuliya.”<verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>“Nhika kwangu, mwaboa monng'alika nukutope ni misigu jejitopiki, nane nitenda kumpomulesa. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Mlikonga kingolingoli sangu, mwikilibola kuhuma kwangu, ndaba nepani numpoli na jojunyenyeke mioju, nanamu myoju jinu jiitenda kupomulela, <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Ndaba kingolingoli sangu kitei kujojoka ni misigu jangu ngasejitopike.”<figure style="fig" alt="Two oxen wearing a yoke to plow a field" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" ref="11:30">Ng'ombi ibeli yebikongiki kingolingoli</figure><verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Bambu ju Lisoba lu Kupomulela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maluko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Masoba gala, Yesu jabiya jupeta mumatui gi inganu Lisoba lu Kupomulela, banafunzi baki babiya ni inzala, batumbuliya kuseku kipambiku si inganu nakula inganu yaki. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Lakini Afalisayu pabagabona haga, bumpwagila Yesu, “Linga! Banafunzi baku ahenga lijambu li mihilu Lisoba lu Kupomulela.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Yesu jaalalukiya, “Boo, ngasensomiki lee sejwahengiki Daudi na ajaki pababii ni inzala? <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>Jajingala mu nyumba jaka Sapanga jakula mabumunda gabapiiki palongi jaka Sapanga. Lijambu leheli labii lu nhilu kwabu kula lakini Daudi na ajaki bakuliki. Mabumunda gegala babapalika kula pee agolu kajika. <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Boo, ngasensomiki mukitabu sa Malagalaki gaka Musa agolu ahalabana Malagalaki gi Lisoba lu Kupomulela munyumba jaka Sapanga, lakini ngase abonikana ngati atei kuhalabana? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Henu numpwagi, pamba jubii jojubii nkolongu kupete Nyumba jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Maandiku gaka Sapanga gapwagiki, ‘Mbala ikia wala nga matambiku,’ mwakamanyi maana ja malobi ganga, ngamwakaatemwi bandu banga na mahakau. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Ndaba Mwana waka Mundu ndi Bambu ju Lisoba lu Kupomulela.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu jojulei kuboku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maluko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Yesu jaboka pala, jajenda munyumba jukuketangane Ayaudi, <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>momuje kwabii na mundu jumu junu kuboku kokulei. Ndienu bandu andalukiya Yesu, “Boo, kujetakeka le kundamisa mundu Lisoba lu Kupomulela?” Bundalukiya hela ili apata indela jukuntaki.<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Lakini Yesu ampwagila, “Boo, mundu boo kati jinu likondoo na lihabuki mlibomba Lisoba lu Kupomulela ngajitondabe kuboku kulipia? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Lakini mundu ndi jwa sapi kuliku likondoo! Henu, nga nhilu kuhenga majambu ga amboni Lisoba lu Kupomulela.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Ndipala ampwagila mundu jola, “Nyosa kuboku kwaku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Janyosa kuboku, nakwombi kwalama na kuba ngati kongi kola. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Ndienu Afalisayu bapita kunza bataputa indela jukunkoma Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mtumisi jojuaguliwi na Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Lakini Yesu ejamanya lijambu lela, japita pandu je pala. Na bandu bingi bunkagula najombi jatenda kwaalamisa agonzu boti. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>Jaakanakya baapwagi bandu majambu gaki. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Jatenda hela, ili gajapwaga Sapanga kupete Mlota Isaya gatimia.<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>“Jonzo ndi mtumisi wangu jonuhagwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">mpali wangu jojugutogulesa mwoju wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Naajibeka loho jangu panani jaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">najombi jwiilandila nndema joti kutemu kwangu.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Ngajilosani wala kujamalii kwa sauti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">nga mundu jojijoana sauti jaki mwiindela.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Nndai gogupondiki ngajitunuli wala utambi gogupia lioi ngajisusue,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">mbaka kutemu kwa sakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">kutawala.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Bandu boti bandema joka banhobaliya jombi.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maluko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Ndienu Yesu bundetila mundu jumu jwangalinga kabee jabi kimumuta ndaba jabiya jubii ni ilombu. Yesu andamisa najombi jwawesa kulonge nu kulinga. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Bandu boa basangia ngamaa, nukulaluana, “Boo, jonzo lee nga Mwana waka Daude?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Lakini Afalisayu pabajoa haga, bapwaaga, “Mundu hajo jubenga ilombu ku uwesu waka Belizebuli, nkolongu wi ilombu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Yesu jamanyiki sebawasaliya, jaapwagila, “Ubambu ukolongu wokapi gogubaganiki nukukomana beni kwa beni, gwitenda kuhalabika. Musi au nyumba jokapi jejibaganiki jitenda kuhabuka. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Ana Lijobi liipenga ilombu yaki, hoju jilipenga mwene. Henu, ukolongu waki wiijema bole? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Mwanganya mpwaaga eti menga ilombu ku uwesu waka Belizebuli. Boo, nya jojaapeke bandu bii uwesu ukubenga ilombo? Ndienu bandu bii bene buntemula mwanganya. <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Lakini ana moa ilombu kwa makili ga Loho jaka Sapanga enu mmanya Ubambu ukolongu waka Sapanga guhikiki kwinu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>“Ngamundu jojuwesa kujingi nyumba jaka mundu jwana makili nukunyaga hindu yaki yoti, jitumbuliya oti kunkonga jwana makili jola. Hapa ndi pajiwesa kunyaga hindu yaki.”<verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>“Mundu jwanga kuba pamu nanepani, hoju ndi jojumbenga, na jokapi jwanga kubonga pamu na nepani jutenda kupesangana. <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Henu numpwagi, bandu bilekakiwa kila mahakau namatondu gabu bitenda kulekakewa, lakini jola joantondo Loho jaka Sapanga ngabundekake mahakau ge haga. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Mundu joampwaga liyaa Mwana waka Mundu bitenda kundekake mahakau gaki, lakini joampwaaga liyaa Loho jaka Sapanga, ngabanndekake lihakau lela masoba ganga kujomoka nndema goguhika.<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nkongu na Matunda gaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>“Nkongu gwa sapi gupapa matunda ga sapi, nunkongu guliya gupapa matunda giliya. Nkongu gumanyikana kwa matunda gaki. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Mwanganya mukibeleku si lijoka! Nhwesa boo kupwaaga majambu gamboni koni mwabeti mwambaja? Ndaba mundu jupwaaga gagatweli mmoju jaki. <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Mundu jwa amboni jupia gagabii ga amboni mu kikoku sa hindu yamboni, na mundu juliya jupia majambu giliyaa mu mukikoku sa hindu hiliya.”<verse eid="MAT 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>“Ndienu numpwagi lisoba lu kutemu kila bandu biipalika kutemuliwa kwa kila lilobi langa kupalika leapwaga.” <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Ndaba ja malobi gaku bagutemula ana gubii na mahakau au ngasegubina mahakau.<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kupala nginyuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maluko 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Ndipala abola bangi ba Malagalaki na Afalisayu bumpwagila Yesu, “Mmbola, tupalika kulinga nginyuli kuhuma kwaku.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Lakini jombi jaapwagila, “Kibeleku siliya sanga kuhobaleka! Mpala nginyuli, lakini ngabampeke nginyuli ila nginyuli jaka Yona Mlota waka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Ngati Yona ejatama masoba matatu pipipipi na kelukelu mulutumbu ja homba ngolongu, ndienu Mwana waka Mundu ejitama pai ju nndema masoba matatu pipipipi na kelukelu.” <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Bandu buku Ninawi biijema ni kibeleku ase mlisoba lu kutemu nukuntemu mwanganya. Ndaba bandu buku Ninawi bagaleka mahakau gabu Yona pajalandila kwabu, na pamba jubii nkolongu kupeta Yona! <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Mmasoba gu kutemula, Malikia juku Sheba jijema na bandu bi kibeleku senze, najombi jantemula mwanganya ndaba juhikiki kuhuma kunndema jaki juhikiki kujoane mabolee gana malangu gaka Salumoni, na pamba jubii nkolongu kupeta Solomoni.<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kukelabuka ku kilombu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>“Kilombu esumpita mundu, kiyongolota yongolota mulungwenza kutaputa pandu pukupomulela, na ana ngasekipatiki pandu pukupomulela, <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>ndi salipwagila seni, ‘Ngelubuka kunyumba jangu.’ Lakini pakikelabuka nukukubona nyumba ndopu apyaagi nu kubeka sapi, <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>sijenda kujukuu ilombu yengi saba, ibaja kupeta sombi, na yombi ijingala nukutama momu. Na mundu we wehoju kupogale kwaki kwiikuba kuliya kupeta puwanzu. Ndi ekwibiya kibeleku ase siliya.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyongo waka Yesu na alongu baka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maluko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Yesu pajabiya juendalee kulongee na bandu, amabu baki na akalongu baki bahika nukujema kunza, bapala kulongee naku. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Mundu jumu ampwagila, “Anyongoo baku na alongu baku abii kunza, apala kulongee na wehapa.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Lakini Yesu ampwagila mundu wehoju, “Anyongo bangu ndi nyane? Nakalongu ba ndi akanyane?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Ndipala jaalangia kuboku kwa banafunzi baki nukupwaaga, “Haba ndi aka nyongo bangu na alongu bangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Ndaba jokapi jojihenga gaapala Atati bangu baabii kunani kwaka Sapanga, hoju ndi mmbeli wangu nu nndombu wangu na amabu bangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Lilenganu gu mpanda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maluko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Lisoba lele Yesu jahuma mu nyumba jela, jajenda nukutama mulutengu ju nhanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Nsambi nkolongu wa bandu buyongolota Yesu najombi jwakwela munhwatu nukutama momu, bandu boti bajeema mulutengu ju nhanga.<verse eid="MAT 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Ndipala Yesu jaapwagila majambu gingi ngamaa kwa malenganu, japwaaga, “Nnzoannya! Mpanda jumu jajenda kupanda imbeju. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Pajabiya jwakakweta imbeju, yengi yahabukiya pambipi ni indela, ijuni yahika nakula. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Yengi yahabuka mu malibu punu luhombi lusokopi. Yabonikana imeliki nyata nukukola ndaba lwabii luhombi lusokopi. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Lakini lyoba palanyaka, mimea jejela janyala nukujoma ndaba mikega jaki ngasejahumiki pai. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Imbeju yengi yahabukiya pi mikongu ja miha, nayombi jakola nukujihinya. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Imbeju yengi yahabukiya puluombi lolubolalani, yamei nukupapa, yengi yapapiki imbeju mia na yengi sitini na yengi selasini.”<verse eid="MAT 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Yesu jajomulia kupwaga, “Jwana makutu gukujoa nujujoana!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndaba jukubola kwa malenganu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maluko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Banafunzi baki bunzendila nukundaluki, “Ndaba jaki gulongee na bandu sa malengano?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Jaapwagila, “Mwanganya bumpeki uwesu hukumanya sili ju ubambu ukolongu uku maundi, lakini bombi ngasebaapekie. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Ndaba mundu jojubii na sindu bitenda kunnzonzuke ngani lakini jwanga na sindu, hata sejubinaku sitenda kujukulika. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Ndi ndaba mbwaga naku kwa malenganu, ndaba biilinga lakini ngabiikibone, bijoane lakini ngabiijoane, wala ngabiielewe. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Gatimia gajapwaga Isaya Mlota waka Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Kujoana mbaka bijowani, lakini ngabielewi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Kulinga mbaka alingi, lakini ngamwakibone.<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Ndaba mioju ja bandu aba jitei kunonopa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ngaseajoana kwa makutu gabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">mihu gabu atei kuhigi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Ana ngahela, bakabona kwa mihu gabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">bakajoana kwa makutu gabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">bakaelawa kwa mioju jabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nukung'anumbuki nepani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nane nakabiya nalamisi.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>“Lakini nambanga mwanganya! Ndaba mihu ginu gatenda kulinga, na makutu ginu gatenda kujoa! <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Numpwagi sakaka, alota baka Sapanga bingi na bandu baka Sapanga bingi batokulii ngamaa kugabona gamwagabona, ngasebagabona, nukugajoana gala gamwagajoana, lakini ngasebagabweni wala kugajoana.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaapwagi maana ja malenganu guku mpanda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:13-20">4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>“Ndienu nnzoannya, maana ja malenganu guku mpanda. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Mundu ejijoana lilobi lu Ubambu ukolongu waka Sapanga lakini ngasejilielewa, mundu we hoju julengana ni imbeju yehihabuki mwiindela. Mbaja jihika nukukwelapu seapandiki mmoju jaki. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Imbeju yeihabuki mmalibu ilengana na mundu jojujoana lilobi laka Sapanga, na papa julijopa sukutogule. <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>Lakini ndaba ngaselijingii nkati jaki ngati mikega ejijingi muluhombi, juendale kuhinakali kidogu pena ana bahengi liyaha nakaang'alisa ndaba ji lilobi le heli, ndi jukotoka kuhobale lilobi. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Imbeju yehihabuki pi mikongu ja miha ilengana namundu jojulijoane lilobi, lakini ndaba juku hangajaki womi upundema nu kupala mali ndi kuhalabana lilobi leheli, na ngase jupapa matunda ndaba ngasejuhenga gajupala Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Lakini imbeju yeyahabukiya muluhombi lwa sapi ilengana na mundu jojujoana lilobi nukulielewa, jihenga majambu gingi ga mboni ngati mkongu egupapa matunda, gumu mia na gongi sitini na gongi selasini.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilenganu la manyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Yesu jaapwagila bandu lilenganu lengi, “Ubambu ukolongu ukumaundi gulengana na mundu jojupandiki imbeju ya sapi mulitui laki. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Lakini bandu ana agoni, mbaja waki juhika nukupanda manyai pikilanda ji inganu, nu kuboka. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Ndienu inganu paimela nukutumbuli kupapa, manyai nagombi gabonikana mwi inganu. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Atumi baka mwini litui bunzendila, nukundaluki, ‘Bambu, si wapandiki imbeju ya sapi mulitui lako? Manyai aga gahumiki kwako?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>Jombi jajibua, ‘Mbaja wangu ndi jojuhenga hela.’ Ndienu atumi baki bundalukiya, ‘Boo, gupala le tujenda twakatupulaje?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>Najombi jaapwagila, ‘Ngaela, mwitupula ndaba emwiitupula manyai nhwesa kutupu ni inganu kabee. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Muileka ikola pamu mbaka masoba gukuhusa egihika. Masoba ge haga naapwagila baahusa ntupula hoti manyai nukugakoonga malundumalundu nu kugajosa mwotu, lakini inganu baikusanya nukuibeka mwikikoku sangu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilenganu gi imbeju ja haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maluko 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Yesu jaapwagila bandu kwa malenganu gangi, “Ubambu ukolongu gulengana ni imbeju nzoku ja haladali jejajukwi mundu jumu, japaanda mulitui laki. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Imbeju heji jibii nzoku kupete imbeju yoti, lakini pajikola, mmea waki gukuba nkolongu kupeta mikongu ju mulitui. Nagwombi gukuba nkolongu ni ijuni ihika nukusengale miui mu mambandi gaki.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilenganu la amila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Yesu jaapwagila kabee lilenganu lengi, “Ubambu ukolongu gulengana na amila lejajukua nyongoo jumu, jasanganya nu uwembi madebi mabeli, mbaka uwembi gwoti watenda kututumuka.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulonge kwa malenganu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maluko 4:33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Yesu jaapwagila nsambi bandu majambu haga goa kwa malenganu. Ngase jaapwagila sokapi bila kutumii malenganu, <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>jatenda hela ili litimia lejwapwaaga Mlota waka Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Nipwaaga nabu kwa malenganu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">niiyekula gagahihiki pu nndema tumbuka kubombeka.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaapwagi ndaba ja malenganu ga magogu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Ndipala Yesu jaaleka bandu bala, jajingala mu nyumba. Banafunzi baki bunzendila, bumpwagila, “Tupwajila malenganu ga manyai gabola kike.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Mpanda imbeju ya sapi, ndi Mwana waka Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>Litui lela ndi nndema. Imbeju ya sapi ndi bandu baka Sapanga babube ubambu ukolongu ndi wabu. Lakini manyai gala ndi bandu baka Mbaja jola. <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>Mundu mbaja jojupanda magogu ndi Lijobi. Ilebi ndi mwisu gu nndema gongo, na baahusa ndi Atumi bu kunani kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Ngati manyai ebagabonga nukujosa mwotu, ndi ekwikuba pamwisu ju nndema. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Mwana waka Mundu jaatuma atumi bu kunani kuhuma mu Ukolongu waki abonga kila sindu sesaakolo bandu kuhenga mahakau na baatenda liyaha masoba goti. <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>Nabombi baalekala nkati jitanuli la mwotu nkolongu, hoku bilela nukupola minu. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Ndipala babii baamboni palongi jaka Sapanga biing'ala ngati lyoba mu ubambu ukolongu wa Atati babu. Jwana makutu gukujoane nu jujoana.”<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malenganu ga hindu yu lupija lwingi loluhihiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>“Ukolongu ukunani ukumaundi gulengana na hindu yu lupija lwingi loahihiki mu litui. Mundu pajijibona juhiya kabee. Sukutogule ngamaa jujenda kulombesa indu yoti yejubi naku, ndienu jukelabuka nukulomba litui lela.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malenganu ga sindu sulupija lukolongu bikikema lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>“Kabee, ukolongu uku ukunani gulengana na mundu jojilomba hindu nukulombesa jojutaputa lulu. <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>Pajijibona lulu jimu ja bei ngolongu, jajenda kulombesa yoti yejabinaku nukulomba lulu jela.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malenganu gikilepa sa homba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>“Kabee, ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga kwaka Sapanga gulengana na kilepa sealekaki mu nhanga, gogukamu homba ya sapi nihiliya. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Kilepa esatwelila, aloi buguhuti mulutengu ju unhanga, batama pai, kuhagu homba ya sapi babeka mukitonga, lakini homba iliya yela batenda kuleke. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Ndi ekwibiya mwisu gu nndema, Atumi bu kunani kwaka Sapanga bipitila, baabaganisa bandu abaya na bandu baamboni, <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>na kwaaleke abaya bala mulitanuli la mwotu. Kokuje bilela nukupola minu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hindu inyai na hindu ya mwandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Yesu jalalukiya, “Boo nheliwi le majambu goti haga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Bajibua, “Hena.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Najombi jaapwagila, “Ndienu, kila mmbola wa Malagalaki jojukuba mmbolee ju Ubambu ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga julengana na mundu jwana nyumba jojupia indu yulupija lwingi inyai na hindu yulupija lwingi ya mwandi kuhuma mukikoku saki.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ankana ku Nazaleti kola</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maluko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Yesu pajajomula kwaapwaagi malenganu gala, jaboka pandu pala, <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>jajenda ku nyumba jabu. Kokuje jabiya jaabola bandu mu nyumba jukuketangane Ayaudi. Nabombi balweuki, na babumbona basangia, bundalukiya, “Boo, mundu hajo jupatiki kwaa malangu nu uwesu ukuhenga nginyulila? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Jonioju le nga mwana waka nndanda jola? Boo, amabu baki baakema Malia na alongu baki aka Yakobu na Josepu na Simoni na Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Naka alombu baki ngase abii apamba na twenga? Ndienu jupatiki kwaa goka haga?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Ndienu baatenda kunkana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Lakini Yesu jaapwaagila, “Mlota waka Sapanga anzoane kila pandu, ila ngasebunzoane pa musi jaki na pa nyumba jaki!” <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Ndienu ngasejatei nginyuli hinge ndaba ngase bunhobali pa musi jaki.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwaka Yohana Mmbatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maluko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Masoba gegala, Helodi kilongosi juku Galilaya jajoini lijambu laka Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>Jaapwagila atumi baki, “Hoju Yohana Mmbatisa, jutei kuyoka kuhuma kwa bandu baawii. Henu makili gukutenda nginyuli gahenga lihengu nkati jaki.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Helodi jabiya ankamwi Yohana nukunkonga mukipungu ndaba jaka Helodia, nhwanu waka Pilipi, mbeli waki. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Ndaba Yohana jabiya ampwagi Helodi, “Ngasekupalika wehapa kunzuku Helodia.” <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Helodi japala kunkoma Yohana, lakini jaajogopa bandu ndaba bandu bumbona Yohana ngati Mlota waka Sapanga.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Lakini lisoba lukutogule kusaliwa kwaka Helodi, kamwali waka Helodia jahina palongi ja ageni na Helodi jatoguli ngamaa, <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>henu jalagi kumpeke kamwali sokapi sejiiloba.<verse eid="MAT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Kamwali kwa kwaajowane amabu baki, japwaga, “Mbekiya kimutu saka Yohana Mmbatisa mu kipalu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Bambu nkolongu Helodi jabona usungu ngamaa, lakini ndaba jalapa palongi ja ageni bingi lisoba lukutogule lela, jalagalakiya ampekiya. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Helodi andagalakiya mundu akusekula umutu Yohana Mmbatisa mkipungu mola. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Umutu waki baleta mu kipalu, nukumpeke kamwali jola, najombi jaapelakiya amabu baki. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Banafunzi baka Yohana bahika, bajukua nhyega jaka Yohana nukutaga, ndipala bajenda kumpwagi lijambu leheli Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaapeke posu bandu bingi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:30-34">Maluko 6:30-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Yesu ejapata lijambu leheli, jaboka nu nhwatu kujenda pandu panga bandu. Lakini bandu pabapata lijambu, bumpwata kwa magolu kuhuma ku misi jabu. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Yesu pajapita mu nhuwatu nukuhika mulutengu ju nhanga jugubona nsambi wa bandu nkolongu, jaabonila ikia, jaalamisa agonzu babu.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Ekwahika pakamii, banafunzi baki bunzengaliya, bumpwagila, “Pandu pamba pulukoba, na lyoba lijingi, waleka bandu abokannya ili bakalomba posu mwijiji.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Lakini nga lasima kuboka, mwanganya mwabeti mwaapekia poso.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Lakini bombi bapwagila, “Tubii na mabumunda nwanu na homba ibeli pena.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Nnetila pambane.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Jalagalakiya bandu atamannya pai pamanyoi. Jajukua mabumunda gala nhwanu na homba ibeli yela, jalinga kunani kwaka Sapanga, nukunsengula Sapanga. Jasekula mabumunda gala nakaapeke banafunzi baki nabombi babagila bandu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Bandu boti bakula, nukutupi. Ndipala banafunzi batondula ipandi ya posu yeyaigali, batwelakiya itonga komi ni ibeli. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Akanalomi babakuliki baiki elupu unhwano bila kabalanga aka mbomba na bana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jujenda panani ja masi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maluko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Yesu pajabiya jaatabuka bandu jaapwagila banafunzi baki akwela nhwatu, andonguliya kujenda kwii ju nhanga. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Ejajomula kwaatabuka bandu bala jajenda kukitombi kundoba Sapanga, ekwahika pakamii jakabii kajika jaki, <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>nu nhwatu wegola wabia kutali nuku mbwani, lakini waketangana na majeba ni kimbonga kikali.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Ekwahegaliya kusa, Yesu jaajendila banafunzi baki koni jubii panani ja masi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Lakini banafunzi baki pabumbona jujenda panani ja masi, batenda kujogopa. Bapwaaga, “Leneli Lihoka.” Batenda kujamali sukujogopa ngamaa.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Apalapa Yesu jaapwagila, “Ntumbala! Nabii nepane! Mwijogopa!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Petili ampwagila, “Bambu, ana wehapa mbwagila nhika kogubii hoku, koni nyenda panani ja mase.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Ndienu Yesu japwaaga, “Hikajee.” Ndienu Petili jahuluka kunza ju nhwatu, nukujenda panani ja masi, kunzende Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Lakini pajabona unhwai, jajogopa, jatumbuliya kujingi mmasi, jatenda kujamali sukulela, “Bambu, gunhokua.”<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Apalapa Yesu janyosa kuboku kwaki, nukunkamu nukumpwagi, “Wehapa woguhobale kasokopi! Ndaba jaki gutenda kujogopa?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Ndipala bombi pabakwela munhwatu nu nhwai gwatenda kutumbaa. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Boti bababii munhwatu bungungamaliya Yesu, bapwaaga, “Sakaka wehapa wa Mwana waka Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamisa agonzu ku Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maluko 6:53-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Balombuka nhanga, bahika kundema guku Genesaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Bandu pabummanya Yesu, baenisa majambu goti pa ndema joti. Ndienu bandu bundetila Yesu agonzu boti. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Bundoba jaalekakiya agonzu akamula lupeta lwii ingobu jaki. Naboti babunngusa batenda kulama.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Mabolee gaka hoku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maluko 7:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Ndi Afalisayu na Abola ba Malagalaki babahuma ku Yelusalemu, bunzendila Yesu nukundaluki, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Ndabajaki banafunzi baku ngase ajetake mabolee gatujopiki kuhuma kwaka hoku bito? Paakula ngaseasamba maboku gabu sapi!”<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Yesu jaajibua, “Ndabajaki na mwanganya ngase mpwata malagalaki gaka Sapanga ila mpwata mabolee ginu mwabete? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Sapanga jupwagiki, ‘Waatendila isima atati baku na amabu baku na jojwaapwaga giliyaa atati baki na amabu baki jukomika.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Lakini Mwanganya mbola bandu eti ana mundu jubi na sindu sejuwesa kwaajangati atati baki au amabu baki, lakini na sindu sehesi ampiiki Sapanga,” <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>Henu ngasejupalika kabee kwaajangati sindu atati baki. Ndi emulileka lilobi laka Sapanga nukupwata mabolee ginu mwabee. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Mwanganya nkopake mwamboni pamiu jabandu! Isaya Mlota waka Sapanga junndotila sakaka mwanganya pajwapwaga,<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>“Bandu haba andende isima kwa malobi pena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">lakini mmyoju jabu abii kutali na nepani.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Kunumbali kwabu kwa bwakaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">ndaba baabola bandu malagalaki ga bando kuba ngati malagalaki gango.”<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hindu yeyuhenga mundu kuba juliyaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maluko 7:14-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Yesu jwaakema bandu nakwaapwagi, “Nzowana sapi nukuelewa malobi ganumpwagi! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Sindu sesunhenga mundu kuba mpija nga sekijingi mundomu, ila sekipita munndomu. Hesi ndi sesunhenga mundu kuba mbaja.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Ndi abole baki bunzendila nukundaluki, “Boo, umanyi Afalisayu bayomiki ngama pabajogwana malobi gaku?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Lakini jombi jwaapwagila, “Kila nkongu gwanga kupandwa na atati bangu bu kunani, gwitenda kutupuliwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Mwaalekaje! Bombi bangalinga, baalongosa bangalinga ajabu, Jwangalinga na andongo jwangalinga jongi, boka abeli baabukiya mulibomba.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Petili japwaga, “Tupwagila maana jililenganu heli.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yesu jalalukiya, “Hata mwanganya lee mwakona ngasenhelewa? Ngasenhelewa sindu sekijingi munndomu kijenda mulutumbu nukupita kunza kujenda mu likelo? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Mwakona ngasemmanyiki kila sekijingi mundomu kijenda mulutumbu nukupiti kulikelo? <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Lakini malobi gagapita punndomu, gahuma nkati kumoju, na haga ndi gaguhenga mundu jubiya mpija. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Ndaba mmoju gapita mawasu giliyaa nu kukoma na ugoni na kunng'anambuka mundu na kukopake waamboni kwa bandu na wii niisoli na matondu. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Haga ndi gagunhenga mundu kuba juliyaa. Lakini kulaposu bila kusamba maboku ngasekunhenga mundu kuba mpija.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhobale kwaka mmbomba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maluko 7:24-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Yesu jaboka pala, jajenda kundema uku Tilo nuku Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Nyongo jumu juku musi uku Kana, jukubika jutama pambipi na misi heji, anzendila Yesu koni jakalela sukujamali, “Bambu, Mwana waka Daudi, naandi gumone ikia! Mwana wangu jubii nikilombu, sunng'alisa ngamaa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Lakini Yesu ngasejajibwiki sindo. Ndi banafunzi baki bunzendila nukundoba, “Mpwagila jubokaje ndaba jutupwata na jutupege keleli!”<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Andumiki kwa bandu buku Izilaeli pee baahobiki ngati makondoo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Ndipala mmbomba jola anzendila, angungamaliya nukupwaga, “Bambo, nagunyangatiaje.”<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Ngasapi kujuku posu ja bana nukulekale jimbwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Nyongo jola jwapwaga, “Sakaka bambu, lakini hata himbwa ikula mbuluti yeiabuki pai jamesa jaka bambu wabu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Amabo kuhobale kwaku kukolongu! Nala kuhengika ngati hegulobiki.” Apalapa mwana waki jatenda kulama.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jwaalamisa bandu bingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Yesu jwaboka pandu pala, jwajenda pulutengu ju nhanga uku Galilaya. Ndienu jwakwela pikitombi nukutama pai. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Bandu bingi ngamaa bunhikila koni bunndeti ilema na bandu bangakulinga na aka kimumuta na bandu balei na bandu bingi bababi agonzu bumbekila palongi jaki naboti jatenda kwaalamisa. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Nsambi wa bandu gola wasangii ngamaa pawabona, imumuta itenda kulongela na ilema atei kulama na baalei nhyega atenda kujenda na banga kulinga atenda kulinga, bandu bunndumbaliya Sapanga jwa bandu buku Izilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jwaapeke posu nsambi gongi wa bandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maluko 8:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Yesu jaakema banafunzi baki nukupwaga, “Naabone ikia bandu haba, ndaba abii na nepani kwa masoba matatu, na ngaseabi na poso. Ngasembala kwaaleka ajenda bila kula ndaba awesa kuhinduka mwiindela ninzala.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Banafunzi baki bundalukiya, “Pamba tubi kulungwenza, twiipata kwaa posu jukutupi bandu bingi ana?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Yesu japwaga, “Mmbi na mabumunda galenga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Bajibwa, “Saba nutuhomba tusokopi tusokutusoku.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Yesu jwalagalakya banafunzi baki baapwagila bandu atama pai. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Jwajukua mabumunda gala nutuomba tola, ansengula Sapanga nu kunuku, nakwaapeke banafunzi baki nabombi baabagila bandu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Boti bakula nukutupi. Ndienu banafunzi baki batondula ipandi yeiigali, batwelakia itonga saba yeyatweli posu jejahigali. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Babakula babia akanalomi elupu nsesi bila kwaabalanga aka mbomba na bana.<verse eid="MAT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Ndi Yesu jaatabuka bandu, jwakwela nhwatu jajenda musi uku Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Afalisayu apala Yesu juhenga nginyulila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maluko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Afalisayu na aka Asadukayu bunzendila Yesu, bunndenga sukunndoba, julangia nginyuli yeilangi jombi juhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Lakini Yesu jaapwagila, “Lyoba elijingi mwanganya mpwaga, ‘Lelenu kubi sapi ndaba mahundi gakuba makeli!’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Nulukela mpwaga, ‘Lelenu jiikuna hiyula, ndaba kunani kukeli na mahundi gatei kutanda.’ Mwanganya nhwesa kumanya nginyuli ja mahundi, lakini ngasenhwesa kumanya nginyuli ja masoba ganga. <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Bandu bikibeleku salyaa na sanga kuhobaleka! Kipala nginyuli, lakini ngakipati nginyuli jengi jokapi kupeta nginyuli jaka Yona jela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Ndipala Yesu jwaaleka nu kuboka.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amila jaka Afalisayu na Asadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maluko 8:14-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Pababiya alombwiki nhanga, banafunzi baka Yesu bakombuka ajewiki kutoto Mabumunda. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Yesu jwaapwagila, “Ntama miu, mulilenda na amila jaka Afalisayu na Asadukayu!”<verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Banafunzi batumbulia kulaluana beni na beni, “Jupwaga hela ndaba ngasetwatogwi mabumunda.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Yesu jwamanyiki sebabia bakapwaga ndi jaapwagila, “Mwabandu banga kuhobale mwanganya! Ndaba jaki nndaluana mwabeni na beni ndaba ngasembii na mabumunda? <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Boo, mwakona lee ngasenhelewe? Boo, ngase nkomboka panamega mabumunda nhwanu ndaba ja bandu elupu nhwano? Boo, mwatwelaki itonga ilenga yiipandi yeyaihigali? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Amala mabumunda saba gala gabaabagila bandu elupu nsesi bala, boo, mwakusinyi itonga ilenga yeyaigali? <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Ndaba jaki ngase nhelewa nepani ngase nongale mabumunda? Lakini nzepana na amila jaka Afalisayu na Asadukayu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Ndipala banafunzi bala bamanya Yesu ngasejwabia jwaapwagi ajepana na amila ja mabumunda, ila ajepana na mabolee gaka Afalisayu na Asadukayu.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi mwana waka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maluko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Yesu pajwahika ku Kaisalia kojuhumi Pilipi, jwaalalukia banafunzi baki, “Bandu apwaga Mwana waka Mundu ndi nyanye?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Bumpwagila, “Bandu bangi apwaga ndi Yohana Mmbatisa na bangi apwaga ndi Elia na bangi apwaga ndi Yelemia au jumu jwa alota baka Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Na mwanganya boo, mpwaga nee na nyanye?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simoni Petili jwapwaga, “Weapa ndi wa Kilisitu Mwana waka Sapanga jojubi mwomi.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Mbanga wa Simoni mwana waka Yona, ndaba nga mundu jokapi jojukuyekuli haga ila Atati bangu baabi kunani. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Nane nukupwagi wa Petili, weapa lilibu, na panani jililibu hale naguletila bandu bingi ambwata na makili ga kuwa ngagakuwesi. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Nagupekia punguu yu ukolongu ukunani, sokapi sewiogula pundema pani, kwiioguliwa nu kunani kwaka Sapanga kabee nasokapi sewipunga pundema sipungika kunani kwaka Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Ndi Yesu jaakana banafunzi baki bampwaji mundu jokapi ana jombi ndi Kilisitu.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu julongale kung'alika kwaki na kuwa kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maluko 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Toka pala Yesu jwatumbulia kwaapwagi hotuhotu banafunzi baki kupwaga jupalika kujenda ku Yelusalemu, nakola jwitenda kung'aliswa ngamaa mang'alisu gabiileta aseja na aka agolu akolongu na aka abola bamalagalaki. Kabee biitenda kunkoma na jwiitenda kuyoka lisoba la tatu.<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Ndi Petili anzuku Yesu pulutengu nukundakali, “Ngahela Bambu! Lijambu heli nga lugupate!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Lakini Yesu jwang'anambuka nukumpwagi Petili, “Tama kutali na nee, Lijobi wee! We gupala kumbengale nepani. Mawasu gaku ngasegahuma kwaka Sapanga ila ga bandu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Ndi Yesu jwaapwagila abole baki, “Mundu jokapi jojupala kuba mbolee jwangu nepani, julikana mweni, jujukua nsalaba waki, jumbwata. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Ndaba mundu na jupala kuulenda womi waki mweni, jwitenda kuguhoa, lakini mundu jo juguhoa womi waki ndaba jangu, jwitenda kugupata kabee. <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Boo, mundu jwiipata sindu boo ana jupatiki hindu yoka yu pundema pani na papuje juhoiki womi waki mwene? Au mundu jwipia sindu boo ili jupata kabee womi wake? <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Ndaba Mwana waka Mundu jwiika nu Ukolongu wa Atati baki, pamu na atumi baki bu kunani na pala ndi pabantemula kila mundu kulengana na mahengu gaki. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Numpwagi sakaka, abi bangi apambane ngaakue mbaka pabaambona Mwana waka Mundu pajihika koni jubii mu Ubambu Nkolongu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu jung'anambuka pamihu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maluko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Pagapeta masoba sita, Yesu jwaajukua Petili na Yakobu nundongu waki Yohana nukujenda nabu kunani ji kitombi kilasu kobabii kajika jabu. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Pababiya bukundingaliya, apalapa Yesu jwang'anambuka kubonikana kwaki. Pamihu jaki panang'ana ngati lyoba ni ingobu yaki yabii ihuu kupukupu ngati unang'anu. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Ndienu Musa na Elia batenda kupiti, babia alonge na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Ndienu Petili ampwagila Yesu, “Bambu kwibia sapi twepani kutama paambane! Ana gupai niisenga indamba itatu, simu saku na simu saka Musa na simu saka Elia.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Petili pajabia jwakona jakalongila, lihundi lununang'anu latenda kwaayekale, na sauti jajogwanika kuhuma pilihundi lela, “Hajo Mwana wangu jonumpai, jojunengani, munzowania.”<verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Banafunzi bala pabajowania sauti jela, bajogupa ngama, batenda kukupama. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Yesu jwaapwata, nakagusa nakapwagi, “Nzemania, mwiijogopa!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Pabalinga kunani, ngasebumbweni mundu, ila pee Yesu kajika jaki.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Pababia ahuluka kuhuma kukitombi, Yesu jwaalagalakiya, “Mwampwagi mundu majambu ga mugabweni mbaka Mwana waka Mundu pajwiiyoka kuhuma kwa bandu baawii.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Ndi banafunzi bundalukia, “Enu ndaba jaki abola ba malagalaki apwaga juhika hote Elia?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Sakaka Elia jwiika hoti nukugabeka majambu goti sapi. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Lakini numpwagi, Elia juhikiki nabombi ngasebugumanyike, ila buntendila ngati hebapai. Ahelahela Mwana waka Mundu bang'alisa mwamaboku gabu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Ndienu banafunzi baka Yesu bamanya Yesu jwabia anndongale Yohana Mmbatisa.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu andamisa nkombu jwini kilombu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maluko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Pabuguhikila nsambi wa bandu, mundu jumu anzendila Yesu nukumpege magoti palongi jaki, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>nukupwaga, “Bambu umbonila hikia mwana wango ndaba jubi ni kihinduhindu, kabee jung'alika ngamaa, mala jingi juhabuki pamotu au mmasi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Nunndetiki kwaaka banafunzi baku lakini ngase bawesiki kunndamisa.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Mwanganya mukibeleku sanga kuhobale na sekihobiki mwee! Niitama na mwanganya mbaka lile? Nanhinakalia mwanganya mbaka lile? Munndeta pani nkombu hoju.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Yesu jukilakalia kilombu sela nasombi satenda kupita. Nunkombu wejola jwalama apalapa.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Ndi banafunzi bunzendila Yesu puujobu, nukundaluki, “Ndaba jaki twepani ngasetwawesiki kukipia kilombu sela?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Yesu jajibua, “Ndaba nhuobale kasokopi. Numpwagi sakaka, ana pee mmbii na nhobale nzoku ngati imbeju ja haladali, mwiwesa kukipwagi kitombi ase, ‘Boka hapa ujenda pala,’ Nasombi kiitenda kujenda. Nga sindu sokapi sesisindikana kwinu. <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>Lakini kilombu ngati ase ngakuwesa kupita kwindela jokapi ila kukiboa ila sukundoba Sapanga nukupunga kula.”<verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu julongale kabee kuwa kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maluko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Banafunzi boti ebahika ku Galilaya, Yesu jwaapwagila, “Mwana waka Mundu bantenda kunkamula nukunkabisa kwa bandu, <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>nabombi biitenda kunkoma lakini lisoba la tatu jwiitenda kuyoka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Banafunzi baki gwaabina mwoju ngamaa.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulepa kodi ja Nyumba jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Yesu na banafunzi baki pabahika ku Kapelinaumu, bandu bababia ajopa kodi Nyumba jaka Sapanga bunzendila Petili nukundaluki, “Boo, mbola waku julepa kodi ja Nyumba jaka Sapanga?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Petili jwajibua, “Helo, julepa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Petili pajwajingala mu nyumba, kabula ngasejupwajiki lilobi, Yesu jatumbuliya kumpwagi, “Wa Simoni gubona boo? Aka bambu akolongu bupunndema ajopa ushulu na kodi kuhuma kwaka nyane? Kuhuma kwa benei au kwa agene?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Petili jwajibwa, “Kuhuma kwa ageni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesu jwapwaga, “Gupwajiki sapi, benei ngaseapalika kulepa. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Lakini ngasetupalika kwaajege inyela bandu haba. Jenda kunhanga, wakalekala ndoana jaku, na homba ja kwanza jegulonguli kulopo, ukananungula nndomu waki ndipala ukijiketaniya lupija nkati. Wiijukua lupija lola ili wakaalepa kodi jaku na kodi jango.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Nya jojubii nkolongu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maluko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Apalapa banafunzi baka Yesu bunzendila, Yesu nu kunndaluki, “Nyaa nkolongu mu ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Yesu ankema mwana nsoku nukunzemeka pikilanda jabu. <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>Japwagila, “Numpwagi sakaka ana ngaseng'anambwiki na kulengana ngati mwana nsoku, kyee nganzingi mu ukolongu ukunani. <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Jokapi jojulibona ngasindu ngati mwana nsoku ajo, hoju ndi nkolongu mu ukolongu ukunani. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Jokapi joanzopa mwana nsoku ngati jonzo kwii liina langu, hoju junyoopa nepani.<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sindu sesunkolo mundu kuhenga mahakau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maluko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>“Jokapi joankolo jumu ja bana asokopi baanhobale nepani atenda mahakau, kwakabia mbanga bunkonga lilibu lukupole pahingu nukundeke punhanga pandu papanyoliki.Bandu abeli apola kukutumi lilibu lukupole. <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Misibikiboni bandu bupunndema ndaba jakwaakolo bangi kutenda mahakau. Kukolo lasima kupitila lakini misijukiboni mundu jojwaakolua bangi haga gapitila.<verse eid="MAT 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>“Ana kuboku kwaku au kugolu kwaku kukukolwi kuhenga mahakau, nambanga ukusekula nukukuleke kutali naweapa. Nambanga kujingi mu womi wa masoba goti bila kuboku au kugolu kuliku kukuleke mmwotu wa yaka petapeta koni ubii na maboku gabeli na magolu gaku gabeli. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Liu laku ana lukukolwii kuhenga mahakau, litupula nukulileke kutali na weapa. Nambanga gujingila mu womi wa masoba goha koni gubi naliu limu, kuliku kujingi mu motu uku jehanamu koni ubii na miu gaku goka mabeli.<verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilenganu likondoo lelihobiki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>“Mulilinga, mwaambona jumu kati ja bana aba ngati nga sindu sukuhobale. Numpwagi, atumi babu bu kunani abi masoba goha pambipi na Atati bangu kunani kwa mahundi. <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>Ndaba Mwana waka Mundu juhikiki kwaagombo bandu baahobiki.”<verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>“Mmbona boo? Mundu na jubi na makondoo makomi komi, ana limu lihobiki jutenda boo? Jwagaleka makondoo tisini na tisa gala kukitombi, nukujenda kulitaputa limu lelihobiki. <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Numpwagi sakaka, ana julipatiki julitogule lelu ngani kupeta makondoo makomi tisa na tisa gagabia ngasegahobiki gala. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Ahelahela, Atati bitu bu kunani ngasejupala mundu hata jumu kati ja asoku aba ahoba.”<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongu waku najugukosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>“Ndongu waku na jukukosi, unzendila ukumpwagila likosa laki weapa na jombi pambii mwakajika. Najugujowani, jibiya ndongu waku kabee. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Ana jukaniki kugujowane, unzukua mundu jumu au abeli pamu na wamweti, ili kila lilobi ajowana bandu abeli au atatu ngati Maandiku gaka Sapanga hegapwaga. <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Ana ngasejwajogwani na haba, wakaapwagila bandu babunhobale Sapanga. Ana jukaniki kwaajoane bandu babunhobale Kilisitu kwaku weapa jiibiya ngati bandu banga kummanya Sapanga na ngati bandu babaajopa bandu kodi.”<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kukanaki nukujetake kuhenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>“Numpwagi sakaka, sokapi semwikikanakia punndema pani kibia bikikanaki nu kunani kwaka Sapanga, na sokapi semwakijetakiya pundema kibia bikijetaki kunani.”<verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>Kabee numpwagi, abeli kati jinu ana ajetangani pundema pani kuloba sindu sokapi kwaka Atati na Atati bangu bu kunani jwantendila sindu hesi. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Ndaba pokapi pala paketangana, bandu abeli au atatu kwi liina langu, nepani mii apalapa pamu nabu.<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilenganu lukulekake bandu bangi mahakau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Petili anzendila Yesu nukunndaluki, “Boo, Bambu, nndongu wangu ana jungosi nunndekakia mala palenga? Amala nundekakiya mala saba?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Ngasembwaga pee mala saba, lakini hata makomi saba mala saba. <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>Ndaba ukolongu ukunani ulengana nu nkolongu jumu jojaamua kukagu lupija lwaki loabinaku bandu baahenge lihengu mumali gaki. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Hejwatumbuliya kubalanga bunndetila mundu jojwabia anndaja lupija lwingi ngamaa. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Mundu jola ngasejwabi na sindu sokapi sukunndepa, ndi bambu waki jwaalagalakiya bunndombisa ngati ntumwa, jombi nunhwanu waki na bana baki na nahindu yoka yejubinaku ili julepa lideni. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Ntumisi jola jwapega magoti palongi jaki nukupwaga, ‘Guhinakaliya nane nakulepa kila sindu.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Bambu jola ambonila hikia, nu kunndekake lideni lela, nukundeka jujenda.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>“Lakini ntumisi jola jwaboka, ankolila jumu kati jaatumisi ajaki jojwabi jombi anndaja lupija kidogu. Ankamula nukunhinyati pahingu, nukumpwagi, ‘Nepa lupija lwango.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Ntumisi nnzaki jola najombi jwapega magoti nukupwaga, nu kunndoba, ‘Guinakaliya mbaka nugulepe.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Lakini jombi ngasejwatenda kukana, ila anzegala mukipungu mbaka pajwiilepa lupija lola. <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Atumisi ajaki pababona hela waabina mioju ngamaa, bajenda kupwagi bambu wabu majambu gagapitii pala. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Bambu jola ankema ntumisi jola nukumpwagi, ‘Weapa untumisi mbaja ngamaa! Wanoba nepani nukulekakia lideni laku nane nukulekaki lideni laku loti ndaba wandenda kunoba. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Kupalika gumbonila ikia ntumisi nzaku ngati nepani henugubonila weapa ikia.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Bambu jola jwayomiki ngamaa, ambeka mukipungu anng'alisa mbaka pajwiilepa lideni loti.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>Yesu jaendaliya kupwaga, “Atati bangu bu kunani ebantendila ahelahela, ana ngasemwalekaki alongu bii kuhuma mmyoju jino.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Mabole gukukana kulekana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maluko 10:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Yesu pajajomula kupwaga hela, jwaboka ku Galilaya, jwajenda ku Yudea, kwii ja losi luku Yoludani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Bandu bingi bumpwata kola, najombi jwatenda kwaalamisa.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Afalisayu bangi bunzendila Yesu, nukundaluki sukumpendake, “Boo, sapi lee mwanalomi kuntalika nhwanu waki kwi likosa lokape?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Boo, ngase nsomiki mu Maandiku gaka Sapanga, Sapanga jojabomba mundu toka putumbuli, jabomba mmbomba na mwanalome? <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>Henu Sapanga japwaga kabee, ‘Kwa ndaba heji mwanalomi jaaleka atati baki na amabu baki nukujongana nu nhwanu waki, nabombi abeli haba biibia nhyega jimu.’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Henu bombi nga abeli kabee ila nhyega jimu. Sejukilombangini Sapanga, Mundu jwaakilekanisa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Afalisayu bundalukia, “Henu ndaba jaki Musa jutulagalakia mundu kumpeke nhwanu waki likalatasi luku lekana nukunndeka?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Musa anndekakiya mwaleka akaahanu bii ndaba jukunonopa kwa mioju jiino. Lakini ngase kwabii hela toka pakwatumbulia. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Henu numpwagi, jokapi jojundeka nhwanu waki kwa ndaba jokapi ilapee kwa ndaba ju ugoni, nukujuku mmbomba jongi, jutenda ugoni.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Banafunzi baki bumpwagila, “Ana ndi ekukuba kwaka mwanalomi numbomba nambanga kutama bila kujuku mmbomba.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Nga boka baawesa kulijopa libolee heli, ila pee baapatiki uwesu kuhuma kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Ndaba ibi hindu toauti yeyaahenga bandu biijukuu mmbomba, ndaba bangi asaliwi ahelahe, bangi ndaba bandu baatei abia hela. Bangi ahamwi beni nga biijukue ndaba ju Ubambu ukolongu ukunani. Mundu jojuwesa kulijopa libolee ale julijopa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jwaapenge bana asoku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maluko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Ndi bandu bunndetila Yesu bana ili jwaabekila maboku na kwaalobe. Lakini banafunzi batenda kwaalakali bandu babaaleta bana. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Mwaaleka bana asoku aba ahika kwangu, wala mwaapengale, ndaba ukolongu ukunani ndi wa bandu ngati bana asoku aba.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Ndi jwaabekila maboku ili kwaapenge, nu kuboka pala.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nkombu mwana mali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maluko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Mundu jumu anzendila Yesu nukupwaga, “Mbola ndendakii saamboni ili mbata womi wa yaka petapeta?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Ndaba jaki gunaluki kupete lijambu la ambone? Jubii jumu pee jojubii jwa amboni ndi Sapanga. Ana gupai kujingi mu womi, kamula mihilu jaka Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Mundu jola jwalalukia, “Mihilu bole?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesu jwapwaga, “Wiikoma na wiitenda ugoni na wiijiba na wiilonge isoli, <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>waajoannya atati baku na amabu baku na umpala mundu wa pambipi jaku ngati heulipala wamwe.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Nkombu jola jwapwaga, “Goti aga nagakamwi toka panabii namwana, henu mbongukiki na sengi kike?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Ana gupala kuba wa mundu waamboni sakaka, jenda kalombisa hindu yaku yoka yegubinaku waapekia aka kapuku lupija, wiibia na kikoku kunani, ndi guika kumbwata.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Nkombu jola pajwajogwana hela, jwajenda koni ngasejutogulela, ndaba jabii na mali.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Ndi Yesu jwaapwagila banafunzi baki, “Numpwaagi sakaka kunonwipi ngamaa mundu mwana mali kujingi mu ukolongu ukukunani kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Numpwagi kabee, kunonwipi ngamaa mundu mwana mali kujingi mu ukolongu waka Sapanga, kuliku kinyama sebikikema ngamia kujingi mulihotu la sindanu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Banafunzi bala hebajowana hela, basangi ngamaa, bunndalukiya, “Henu nya jojuwesa kulama?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Yesu jwaalingalia nukupwaga, “Kwa bandu lijambu heli ngaseliwesikana lakini kwaka Sapanga goka gawesikana.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Petili japwaga, “Natwepani, tukilekiki kila sindu tukupwatiki weapa twiipata kike?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Numpwagi sakaka, Mwana waka Mundu pajwiitama pikiteu saki su ukolongu mu nndema nnyai. Mwanganya mwembwatiki nepani, mwiitama mwiiteu komi ni ibeli, koni mukatemula makabila komi ni ibeli guku Izilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Jokapi jojulei nyumba, au nndongu au nndombu au atati au amabu au matui, ndaba jangu nepani, jwiijopa mala makomi komi nukupata womi wa yaka petapeta. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Lakini baabia buutumbulii biikuba ba mwisu, na baabi ba mwisu biikuba buutumbulii.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Baahenga lihengu mulitui li mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>“Ukolongu ukunani ulengana na mundu jojubii nilitui, jojaboka lukela ngani kujenda kwaataputa bandu bukuhenga lihengu mulitui laki li mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>Jajetangana nabu kwaalepa mangengalema gu lupija lulihengu lwi lisoba limu, ndi jwaapelika kulitui laki li mizabibu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Egapeta masaa matatu, jwajenda kabee jwabona bandu bangi ajemiki kuguliu, ngaseabi ni lihengu. <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>Jwaapwagila, ‘Nzendania nanamu mwakahenga lihengu mulitui langu li mizabibu, nane nandepa.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Nabombi bapiti. Jojubi nilitui jola jwaboka kabee saa sita na saa tisa, jahenga kabee ahelahela. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Hesahika saa komi na jimu pakamii jajenda kabee, jwaaketania bandu bangi ajemiki pagulio pala. Jaalalukia, ‘Ndaba jaki nzemiki pamba lyobamutu loti bila lihengu?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Bandu bebala bunzibua, ‘Ndaba ngamundu jojutupeki lihengu.’ Najombi jwaapwagila, ‘Nzendania nanamu mwakahenga lihengu mulitui langu li mizabibu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>“Helajingala lyoba, juni litui jola ampwagila jojujemale litui jola, ‘Waakema baahenga lihengu waalepa lupija lwabu, tumbuliya babatumbulia lihengu kumwisu, nukujomule babatumbulia kuuwanzu bala.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Pabahika babatumbuliya lihengu saa komi na jimu, bajopa kila mundu lupija lwilisoba limu. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Babatumbulia lihengu bala hebahika, bawasalia biipata yingi ngani, lakini hata bombi bapata kipandi simu silingengalema gu lupija lwilihengu lilisoba limu. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Pabajopa lupija lwabu, batumbuliya kunhyome jwinilitui jola. <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>Bapwaga, ‘Bandu babahika kuhenga lihengu pakamii, bahengiki lihengu lisaa limu pee, ndaba ja kii utulepiki kulengana na bombi nakoni twepani tuhinakali lihengu pipipipi na lyoba likali?’ ” <verse eid="MAT 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>“Ndi bambu jola anzibwa jumu wabu, ‘Nkosi wango, ngasenugutei uhune nugupeki setwajetangani! Boo, ngase twajetanganii lee kulepana lupija lwi lisoba limo?’ ” <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Jukua setujetanganile, ujendaje. Ne mbai kumpeke wamwisu jonzo ngati henukupeki weapa. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Boo, ngase mbalika kutumi lupija lwangu ngati hembala? Boo, gubona wipu ndaba nepani naambone?<verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>Yesu jwajomula sukupwaga, “Jojubi jwa mwisu jwiibia jukutumbuli na jojubi juutumbuli jwiibia jwa mwisu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jupwaga mala ja tatu kuwa kwaki nukuyoka kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maluko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Yesu pajwabia jukwela kunani ku Yelusalemu, jwaajukua banafunzi baki komi na abeli pandu panga na bandu, na pababii ajenda mwiindela jwaapwagila, <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>“Nzowana, tujenda ku Yelusalemu, nahoku Mwana waka Mundu bankabisa kwaka agolu akolongu naaka abola ba malagalaki, nabombi bantemula jukomika. <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>Ndipala baampelika kwa bandu banga Ayaudi ili bumpoalihamu, bunndapula iboku nukumbambali punsalaba lakini lisoba la tatu jwiitenda kuyoka.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuloba kwaka nyongo jumu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maluko 10:35-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Ndipala nhwanu waka Zebedayu pamu na bana baki anzendila Yesu, jwapega magoti palongi jaki nukunndoba anhengila sejupala.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Yesu anndalukia, “Upala kike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Nyongo jola jwapwaga, “Pepakoku, lagalakiya pawiibia mu ukolongu waku, bana bangu abeli abaa atama jumu upandi waku wa malele na jongi upandi waku wa mangega.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Yesu jwaapwagila, “Ngase mukimanyi sendoba. Boo, nhwesa kunywele kikombi seniinywelila nepani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Bajibwa, “Tuwesa.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Yesu jwaapwagila, “Sakaka mwiinywelila kikombi sangu samang'aliku, lakini kutama kumalele au kumangega kwangu nepani, nga lihengu langu ne kuhagula. Biitama babaabeki Atati bangu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Banafunzi bangi komi bala hebajogwana haga, baayomila aka kilongu abeli bala. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Ndi Yesu jwaakema, nakaapwagi, “Mmanyiki aka kilongosi na bandu banga Ayaudi baalongo bandu kwa makili, na aka akolongu babu apala kwahenga bandu haba kuba bandu babu. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Lakini kwinu mwanganya kwiikuba hela, ila jojupala kuba nkolongu kati jinu jubia ntumisi jwa boti, <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>na jojupala kuba juutumbuli kati jinu jubia ntumika wino. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Ahelahela, Mwana waka Mundu ngasejwahika kutumakaliwa, ila kutumiki bandu nukupia womi waki kwa gombo bandu bingi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jwaalamisa banga linga abeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maluko 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Yesu na banafunzi baki pababia aboka kumusi uku Yeliko, nsambi wa bandu watenda kumpwata. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Kwabia na banga linga abeli atemi pulutengu lwi indela, na pabajowana Yesu jwabia jupeta pala, bajamalia, “Bambu, Mwana waka Daudi utubonila ikia!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Nsambi wa bandu bala waalakalia nakaapwagi atama kinunu. Lakini bombi bajamalia ngani, “Bambo, Mwana waka Daudi utubonila ikia!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Yesu jwajema, nakaakema nakaalaluki, “Boo, mpala nunhengila kike?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Bunzibwa, “Bambu, tuloba mihu gitu galinga.”<verse eid="MAT 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Yesu jwaabonila ikia, jwaagusa mihu gabu na apalapa bawesa kulinga nabombi nukumpwata.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu jujingi ku Yelusalemu sukutogule</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Yesu na banafunzi baki pa bahegali kuhika ku Yelusalemu, bahika ku Betifage pi Kitombi si Mizeituni. Yesu jaatama kola na banafunzi baki abeli, <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>jaapwagila, “Nzendania mbaka kukijiji sekibi palongi ji, pala mwalibona liponda bilikongiki na mwana waki. Mwakagabopula mwagaleta kwangu. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Ana mundu jundaluki sokapi mumpwagila, ‘Bambu jutenda kugapala, najombi jandekakiya mmboka.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Lijambu heli la hengika ili gajwapwaga mlota waka Sapanga gatimia,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>“Mwaapwagila bandu buku Sayuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Lingaliya, Bambu Nkolongu waku jutenda kuhika!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Mpoli na jukweliki mu liponda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">libana liliponda, mwana wi liponda kinyama sekitoto misigu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Ndi, banafunzi bala bajenda nukutenda ngati Yesu hejwaalagalakia. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Biilileta liponda lela nilibana laki, batandika ingobu yabu panani ja liponda na Yesu jwatama panani jaki. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Nsambi wa bandu batandika ingobu yabu mwiindela, na bandu bangi basekula matutu gimikongu nukugagoneka mwiindela. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Nsambi wa bandu gogunndonguli na babupwata bajamalia, “Ulumbi kwaka mwana waka Daudi! Jupengalika jojuhika kupete lihina laka Bambu! Ulumbi kwaka Sapanga kunani!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Yesu jajingala kumusi ku Yelusalemu, bandu boka batenda kujabalika nukulaluki, “Boo hajo nyane?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Bandu munsambi gola bapwaga, “Hajo mlota waka Sapanga, Yesu kuhuma ku Nazaleti musi uku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jubii pa Nyumba jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maluko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Yesu jwajingala pa Nyumba jaka Sapanga, jwaabenga kunza bandu bababia alomba nuku lombesa hindu. Jwapendula mesa ja bandu bababia aba abadisani lupija, niiteu ya bandu baabia alombesa ngunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>Jwaapwagila, “Ahandiki mu Mahandiku gaka Sapanga, ‘Nyumba jangu jiibia nyumba jukundobe Sapanga.’ Lakini mwanganya mujing'anambwi kuba lipoli la bii!”<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Bandu banga kulinga na niilema bunzendila Yesu pa Nyumba jaka Sapanga, na Yesu jwatenda kwaalamisa. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Lakini agolu akolongu na aka abola ba malagalaki pababona ndonduke yejwatei Yesu, na kabee bana pababia ajamali kwa sauti jabu pa Nyumba jaka Sapanga bakapwaga, “Ulumbi kwaka mwana waka Daudi,” Bombi batenda kuyoma. <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Ndi bumpwagila, “Boo, ngasegujogwana seapwaga bana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesu japwaga, “Helo, nyowana! Boo, ngasenhwahiki lee kusoma mahandiku agaga? ‘Kwi milomu ja bana asoku na bana baajonga ulipati ulumbi wa sakaka.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Yesu jwaaleka, jwajenda ku Betania, kunza ja musi kojabii, nukugone koku.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jugulapi mbamba nkongu gu ntini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maluko 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Pulukela ngani Yesu pajwabi jubuja ku musi, jummbina inzala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Juubona nkongu wu ntini gumu pulutengu jiindela, juujendila lakini juuketanya ngasegubi na sokape ila pe mahamba matopu. Ndii juupwagila, “Wiibeleka kabee matunda masoba goti!” Apalapa nkongu wo ntini gola gwatenda kunyala.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Banafunzi pababona basangi nukupwaga, “Nkongu ago gunyaliki boo nyatanyata?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Yesu jwapwaga, “Numpwagi sakaka, ana mwikuba ni lihobale bila lujogopu, unhuwesa kuhenga nga pe seehengiki mu nkongu ago pena, ila hata na mukipwagi kitombi ase, ‘Tupuka ulilekala munhanga,’ kwiihengika ahelahela. <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Ana mbi nilihobale, sokapi semwiloba kwaka Sapanga mwiitenda kupata.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uwesu waka Yesu guhuma kwako</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maluko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Yesu jwajingala pa Nyumba jaka Sapanga, pajwabia jutenda kubola, agolu akolongu na aseja ba bandu bundalukia, “Guhenga majambu haga kupete uwesu bole? Nya jojugupeki uwesu gwehogu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Yesu jwajibua, “Nanepani nundaluki lijambu limu, ana nhnyibwiki, nane nampwagila nhenga majambu haga kupete uwesu boo. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Boo, uwesu waka Yohana ukubatisa wahuma kwaka nya? Boo, wahuma kunani au kwa bando?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Lakini batumbuliya kulaluana beni kwa beni, “Ana tupwagiki, ‘Gahuma kunani,’ jwatulalukia, ‘Henu mbona ngase munhobale Yohana?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Natupwagiki ‘Guhuma kwa bandu,’ twaajogopa bandu haba ndaba boti ajetake Yohana mlota waka Sapanga.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Ndi bunzibua, “Ngasetumanya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Najombi Yesu jwapwaga, “Nanepani nganumpwagi nhenga haga kupete uwesu boo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilenganu la bana abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>“Mwanganya mmbona boo? Mundu jumu jwabi na bana abeli. Ampwagila mwana nkolongu jola, ‘Mwanango, lelenu jenda ukahenga lihengu ku lituhi li mizabibu.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Nkombu jola ampwagila, “Nganyende!” Lakini mwonikatai jwaamua kujenda nukuhenga lihengu. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>“Ahengo bala bajenda kumpwagi kabee mwana waki wa pili jola ahelahela, najombi jwajibwa, ‘Koonyenda atati.’ Lakini ngasejwapiti ku lihengo.” <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Boo, kati ja abeli haba nya jojwahengiki sebapala atati bake?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Bajibwa, “Mwana nkolongu jola.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Ndi Yesu jwaapwagila,Ndi Yesu jwaapwagila, “Numpwagi sakaka, baajopa kodi na agoni banndonguliya kujingi mu ukolongu waka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Ndaba Yohana jwahika kwinu nukunndangi ndela jejupala Sapanga, nanamu ngasemunhobalile, lakini baajopa kodi na baatenda ugoni bunhobali. Pamu na kugabona goti haga mwanganya ngasemwalekaki mahakau nukunhobale.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilenganu lilitui li mizabibu na babesiki litui</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maluko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Yesu jwaapwagila, “Nzowania lilenganu lengi. Mundu jumu mwana litui japandiki mizabibu mu litui, juliyongulaki ua litui leheli, jwahembiki libomba lukuminyi zabibu, jwasenga kindamba kilasu sukulonde. Ndi jilibesiki kwa bandu baalema, mweni jwajenda ku ndema jukutali. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Masoba gukuhusa egahika, jwaatuma atumika baki kwaaka bandu baalema bala, ili kujuku lipungu laki kuhuma kwa yeahusika. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Bandu baalema bala baakamula atumika bala, jumu batenda kunndapu, jongi batenda kunkoma na jongi bunndapula na malibu. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Mundu jola jwaatuma kabee atumika bangi, bingi kupeta babalonguli bala. Baalema bala bababesa lituhi baatendila ngati bangi bala. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Mwisuwe antuma mwana waki koni jwaka wasalia, ‘Mwana wangu biitenda kunzoanela.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Lakini baalema bala pabumbona mwana waki, balongalania beni kwa beni, ‘Jonzo ndi nndisi waki, tunkomaji ili twiilisa litui lenu!’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Ndi bunkamula nukumpia kunza ji litui li mizabibu lela, nukunkoma.<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>“Henu, munilitui li mizabibu pajwihika, jwaatenda boo bandu baalema bala?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Bombi bunzibua, “Kye jiitenda kwakoma bandu abaja haba, ni litui lee jaapekiya bandu bangi litui nabombi bambaguliya zabibu mu masoba gukuhusa.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Ndi Yesu jwaapwagila, “Boo, ngasemwasomiki lijambu heli mu Maandiku gaka Sapanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Lilibu le bilikana bandu baasenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">henu ndi lenieli lilibu lelipalika kuba lunsingi kupeta goka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Lijambu hale lihuma kwaka Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">nalombi lisangasa ngamaa kwitu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>“Henu numpwagi, Ukolongu waka Sapanga biitenda kukwepatu kwinu na kwaapeke bandu bangi babagahenga gagunndengane Sapanga.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Jojwiiabukia panani ji lilibu heli jwitenda kutunuka ipandiipandi, ana lunhabuki mundu jokapi, jwitenda kupondeka.<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Aka agolu akolongu pamu na aka Afalisayu pabajogwa malenganu gaki, bamanya Yesu jwabia jwaapwaga bombi. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Henu babia ataputa indela jukunkamu, lakini baajogupa bandu ndaba bombi buholaliya Yesu ndi mlota waka Sapanga.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s">Tipati ja posu ja ndoa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Yesu jalongila nabu kabee kwa malengano nukupwaga, <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>“Ukolongu u kunani kwaka Sapanga gulengana na Bambu nkolongu jumu ehantendila mwana waki tipati ga posu ja kutola mmbomba. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Ndienu jaatuma atumika baki bakaakema bajwaakokiki ahika pa tipati, lakini bajaakokiki bala batenda kukana kuhika. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Ndienu jatuma kabee atumika bangi japwaga, ‘Mwaapwagila banaakokiki bala, ndeliki posu ja tipati, nzinziki likambaku la ng'ombi na ng'ombi yengi yeikendiki, nakila sindu kibii sapi. Nhikaniya ku tipati ga posu ja kutola mmbomba.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Lakini bandu bala batenda kusonzoa, kila mundu jajenda kulihengu laki, jongi kulituhi laki na jongi jajenda kukuhemalesa nukulombase hindu yaki. <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>Bangi baakamula atumika bala baalapula na kaakoma. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Bambu nkolongu jola jatenda kuyoma. Jaatuma alonda baki bakaakoma bandu babakomiki atumika baki bala, nukugujosa mwotu musi wabu. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Ndienu jaapwagila atumika baki, ‘Tipati ja posu ju kutola mmbomba jabii sakaka, lakini banaakokiki ngasebapalika kuhika. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Ndienu nzendaniya pa maagobukanu mwakakema bandu boka bamwaabona, akahika pa tipati ga posu ju kutola mmbomba.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Atumika bala babokaniya, bajendaniya mwindela, baaleta bandu boka babaakolila, ba asapi na abaja. Nanyumba ja tipati jatweli bandu ngamaa.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>“Bambu nkolongu ejajingala nakabona ageni, ambona mundu jumu, ngase juweti ingobu ya tipati ga posu ju kutola mmbomba. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Bambu nkolongu andalukiya, ‘Nkose, gujingi boo mombo bila ingobu ja ndoa?’ Lakini jombi jatama kinunu. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Henu bambu nkolongu jaapwagila atumika baki, ‘Munkonga mu magolu numumaboku mukundekala kunza kulwii. Hoku kwiibiya kilelu nukupola minu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>Yesu jajomuliya kupwaga, “Bingi baakokiki lakini baahaguliwi asokopi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulepa kodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maluko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Afalisayu bajendaniya, bataputa indela jukumpendake Yesu kwa malobi gaki. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Ndienu baatuma banafunzi babu pamu ni kikundi saka Helodi kwaka Yesu, bumpwagila, “Mbola, tumanyiki weapa gupwaga sakaka, naweapa gubola sapi indela jaka Sapanga, bila kujogopa bandu apwagakii, ndaba ngasegulingali pamiu jaka mundu. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Henu utupwagila, boo weapa gubona bole? Boo sapi lee au nga sapi kulepa kodi kwaka nkolongu juku Loma jobunkema Kaisali?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Yesu jugumanyiki mpangu wabu uliyaa henu jalalukiya, “Mwanganya monkopake mwamboni ndaba jaki nndenda kumbendakela? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Nangia hoti lingengalema lu lupija lukulepe kodi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Nabombi bumpekia lingengalema lu lupija. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Yesu jalalukiya, “Pamihu apa na lihina alee laka nyanye?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Bapwaga, “Jaka Kaisali Nkolongu juku Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Apalapa Yesu jaapwagila, “Henu yaka Nkolongu juku Loma mupekia Nkolongu juku Loma na yaka Sapanga mupekia Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Pabajowana ganiaga, basangii ngamaa, bundeka nukubokane.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyoka kwa bandu bawii</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maluko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Lisoba leheli, aka Asadukayu bangi, baapwaga bawi ngase ayoka, bunzendila Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>Bapwaga, “Mbola, Musa japwaga mundu jojutoguliki ana juwii sanga kundeka mwana, kupalika nnuhuna waki anzukua mmbomba jowii alome ili ampapila mmbeli waki we jola bana. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Henu, pitu pani abii akalongu saba. Nkolongu jatoi mmbomba nakuwa, ndaba ngasejapatiki mwana, mbomba we jola antola nnuhuna waki. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Sindu aselase supitila nnuhuna waki wa pili na watatu mbaki wa saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Mwisuwe mmbomba jatenda kuwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Henu, lisoba lukuyoka mmbomba we jola jibiya nhwanu wakanyanye? Ndaba boka saba babiya antoi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Mwanganya nkose ndaba ngase mugamanyi Maandiku gaka Sapanga wala makili gaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Ndaba bandu bawii ebiyoka ngabitoguleki wala kutola, ila biibiya ngati atumi bu kunani kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Lakini lijambu lukuyoka kwa bandu ba wii, boo, ngasensomiki gaju mpwagila Sapanga? Jwapwaga, <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>‘Nepani na Sapanga waka Ibulahimu, Sapanga waka Isaka na Sapanga waka Jakobu.’ Jombi nga Sapanga ba bandu bawii ila Sapanga wa bandu babi bomi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Nsambi wa bandu gola ewajoana gala, basangii ngamaa mabole gaki.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilagisu likolongu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maluko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Afalisayu ebajowana Yesu jabiya jatamisi kinunu Asadukayu, baketangana pamu. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Jumu wabu, jabiya mbola wa malagalaki, jalenga kundaluki Yesu sukumpendake. <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>Andalukiya, “Mbola, nhilu boo gogubii nkolongu mumalagalakila?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yesu japwaga, “Gumpala Bambu Sapanga waku kwa mwoju waku woti, na kwa loho jaku joti na kwamalangu gaku goti. <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Gongo ndi nhilu nkolongu kabee ndi jejilongule. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Jejipwata ndi jenze, ‘Gumpala nnzaku ngati eulipai wamwete.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Malagalaki goti gaka Musa na mabole ga alota baka Sapanga gahobale mihilu mibeli heji.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu bundongale Kilisitu Nkombosi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maluko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Afalisayu pabaketangana pamu, Yesu jalalukiya, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>“Mwanganya mumbona boo, Kilisitu Nkombosi? Boo, jombi mwana waka nyanye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Bombi bapwaga, “Mwana waka Daude.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Henu kubiboo Daudi we kwa makili ga Loho jaka Sapanga ankema jombi Bambo? Pajwapwaga,<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>‘Bambu apwagila Bambu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">tama pamba upandi wangu uku malele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">mbaki panaabeka abaja baku pai ja magolu gako.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Ana Daudi ankema Kilisitu Nkombosi ‘Bambu,’ henu kuwesikana boo jubiya mwana wake?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Ngamundu jokapi jojajibua lilobi. Toka lisoba leheli ngamundu jojalenga kundaluki lijambu lokapi.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s">Nzepana na abola ba Malagalaki na aka Afalisayu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maluko 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luka 11:43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Ndipala Yesu jugupwagila nsambi wa bandu pamu na banafunzi baki. <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>“Aka abola ba Malagalaki na Afalisayu ndi bababi nu uwesu gukubola Malagalaki gaka Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Ndienu nzetakiya nukuhenga goka gabumpwaji kuhenga. Lakini mwiipwata mahengu gabu, ndaba ngaseahenga gala gabundandi. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Bombi akonga misigu jejitopiki nakatweka bandu mwamabega gabu, koni beni ngaseapai kulangi hata lukonzi nukutondabe. <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>Bombi ahenga majambu gabu goka ili abonikana kwa bandu. Awata hipandi ikolongu yiingobu yeahandiki Malagalaki gaka Musa nukujonzuke ulasu wi ingobu yabu. <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Apala kutama ku tipati iteu ya sapi nu munyumba jukuketangane Ayaudi apala kutama iteu ya palongo. <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>Apala kulamukiwa mu maguliu, kabee apala bandu baakema, ‘Mbola.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Lakini mwanganya baankema ‘Mbola,’ ndaba mmbii nu mbola jumu pee, nu mbanganya mwaboti mwa kikilongu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Wala mwankema mundu jokapi pani pundema, ‘Atati,’ ndaba mmbii na atati bamu, ndi baabi kunani kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Wala baankema ‘Akilongosi,’ ndaba mmbii ni kilongosi jumu pee, ndi Kilisitu Nkombosi. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Jojubi nkolongu kati jinu jupalika kuba ntumisi wino. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Jokapi jojulibeka nkolongu biitenda kunhulu, na jokapi jojilihulu ammbeka nkolongu.<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu julakali lijambu lukulikopake wa amboni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maluko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>“Musimukiboni mwaka abola ba Malagalaki na aka Afalisayu! Mo mulikopake mwa amboni! Ndaba mwapungi bandu nndyangu ukujingi mu ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga, na mwabeti ngasenzingii momu, wala ngasemwaajetakale bandu baapala kujingi ajingala.” <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>“Musimukiboni mwaka abola ba Malagalaki na Aka afalisayu mo mulikopake mwa amboni! Mwaanyaga aka mbomba baawii alomi babu hindu yabu, nukukopake mwa bandu baamboni sukuloba sala nasu. Henu mwitemuliwa ngani.<verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>“Musimukiboni mwa abola ba Malagalaki na Afalisayu! Mo mulikopake mwa amboni! Nnzenda munhanga nu munndema kuhenga mundu jumu jupwata indela jinu jukumpwata Sapanga. Namuupatiki muhenga juwesa kujenda kumwotu wanga kususuka mala pabeli ngani.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>“Musimukiboni mwaka kilongosi banga linga! Mwanganya mpwaaga, ‘Mundu najulapiki kwa Nyumba jaka Sapanga, kuliga jee kola nga sindu, ila najulapiki kwa zahabu yu Nyumba jaka Sapanga kuliga kwekola kwiibiya na makili.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Mwanganya mwang'ang'a mwangakulinga! Saa sekibi sapi nakanope, zahabu au Nyumba jaka Sapanga jejihenga zahabu jibiya ja sapi. <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Kabee mpwaaga mundu najulapiki kwa mesa jukupiiki litambiku nga sindu, lakini najulapiki kwa matambiku gaabei panani ji litambiku, kilapu sesela suunkamu mweni. <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Mwanganya mwangalinga! Saa sekibi sapi ngani, boo matambiku au mesa jukupiiki litambiku leligahenga matambiku gabia ga sapi? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Henu, jojulapa kwi litambiku jukuba julapiki pa mesa jukupiki litambiku, na sokapi seabei panani jaki. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Jojulapiki kwa Nyumba jaka Sapanga jukuba julapiki kwa nyumba heji na kabee jukuba julapiki kwa jojutama nkati ja nyumba jaka Sapanga heji. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Najojulapa kwa kunani kwaka Sapanga, julapa kwi kiteu su ubambu saka Sapanga na kwaka Sapanga sejutami.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>“Musimukiboni mwaka abola ba Malagalaki na Afalisayu mwe mwilikopake mwa amboni! Mwaalepesa bandu pandu pamu pa komi ya hindu isoku, ngati manyoi gaganungi sapi, binzali na kalafu na ndimbalila, lakini nkotoka kukamu majambu makolongu ga Malagalaki, kuhenga gajwagapai Sapanga na kuba ni ikia nu kunhobale Sapanga. Ananhengiki haga na mwikotoka na gangi haga. <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Mwakikilongosi mwangakulinga! Mmboa lunzenzema musindu sakunywa sinu, lakini mukimila kinyama sebikikema ngamia!<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>“Musimukiboni mwaabola bamalagalaki na Afalisayu! Mwenkopake mwaamboni mwanganya! Nngoloo nzipuli ni kibega kunza lakini mukuleka nkati kutweli hindu yempatiki kukukwepatu nuusoju. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Weapa mfalisayu jwangalinga! Gulonguliya oti kugolo nnzipuli nkati nikibega, ndienu kunza kwiibiya sapi.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>“Musimukiboni mwaabola bamalagalaki na Afalisayu! Mo mulikopake mwaamboni! Mbii ngati matenge gaapaki langi nhuu, gagabonikana ga sapi sakunza, lakini nkati gatweli maupa ga bandu na kila sindu kibaja. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Ahelahe na mwanganya mbonekana na bandu kwa kunza nnhenga gajupala Sapanga, lakini nkati jii mwaabaja nu usapu wa kila namuna.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutemuliwa kokuhika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>“Musimukiboni mwaabola ba Malagalaki na Afalisayu momlikopake mwaamboni na mwaabaja! Nzengale matenge ga alota baka Sapanga nu kugapamba matenge ga bandu bababi baamboni. <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>Mpwaga, ‘Ana twepani twakabia masoba gaka hoku bitu nga twakajongini nabu kwaakoma alota baka Sapanga!’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Henu nndangi mwabeti ndi mwa bana babaakoma alota baka Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Hena, nhendilia kuhenga batumbulia kuhenga aka hoku bii! <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Mwanganya majoka ni kibeleku si lijoka! Nhwesa boo kukijepa kutemuliwa ku mwotu wangakususuka? <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Henu nundete alota baka Sapanga, bandu babii na malangu na abola. Bangi babu mwitenda kaakoma na bandu bangi mwiitenda kwaabambali pu nsalaba, na bangi mwaalapula iboku munyumba yinu yukuketangane Ayaudi nakaabenga kuhuma mmusi gumu kujenda mmusi gongi. <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Sapanga jammbona mwa bandu biliya ndaba mwaakomiki bandu boti ba amboni, toka kukomeka kwaka Abeli mundu jwa amboni jola mbaka kukomeka kwaka Zakalia mwana waka Balakia jomunkoma pikilanda ja Nyumba jaka Sapanga na mesa jukupiki litambiku. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Numpwagi sakaka, kibeleku senze kitenda kutemuliwa ndaba ja majambu ganga.<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jaapai bandu buku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>“Mwabandu buku Yelusalemu! Mwabandu buku Yelusalemu! Mwanganya mwaakoma alota nakalapu malibu babatumiki kwinu, natokuli ngamaa kwaabeka pamu bana binu ngati ingoku eijobate ibana yaki kwa mapapati gaki lakini mwanganya ngasemwapaile. <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Henu nyumba ji jaka Sapanga bijilei lihami. <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Numpwaji ngamwimoni kabee mbaka lisoba lemwipwaaga, ‘Jupengilika jojuhika ku lihina laka Bambo.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu julongale kubomboka kwa Nyumba jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maluko 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Yesu japita pa Nyumba jaka Sapanga, pajabiya jakajenda, banafunzi baki bunzendila, nukulangi Nyumba jaka Sapanga easengiki. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Yesu jaapwagila, “Boo, mgabona le manyumba gangane. Numpwagi sakaka ngalihigali lilibu panani ji lilibu lengi, kila lilibu liihabuliwa pai.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Babumpwata Yesu biing'alika ngamaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maluko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Yesu pajabii jutemi panani ji Kitombi si Mizeituni, banafunzi baki bunzendila pa kajika bundalukiya, “Tupwagila majambu haga gipitila lile? Na nginyuli boo jewilangia kuhika kwaku na mwisu upundema pane?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Yesu jajibua, “Nnzepana mundu jwankonga. <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Ndaba bandu bingi bihika ku lihina langu koni apwaaga, ‘Nepani ndi Kilisitu,’ nabombi baakonga bandu bingi. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Mwijowana ngondu na majambu ga ngondu, lakini mwijogopa. Ndaba ganiaga gapalika kupitila hoti, lakini mwisu upundema wakona ngaseguhikike. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Musi gumu guikomana na musi gongi, ukolongu gumu gwikomana nu ukolongu gongi. Kwiibiya ni ling'ai li inzala ni kililima kila pandu. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Haga goti gibiya ngati utumbuli gulipyanda ukubeleka mwana.”<verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>“Ndienu bantenda kunng'anambuka nukunng'alisa nu kunkoma. Bandu boti bupunndema bansukila ndaba jukunhobale nepani. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Masoba ge haga bandu bingi biikotuka kuhobale, biing'anambukana nu kusukiana. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Biipitila alota bingi biisoli, nakaakonga bandu bingi. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Ndaba jukujonzukeka ubaja ngani, upali wa bandu bingi gwiitenda kupongoo. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Lakini jojwihinakaliya mbaka pamwisu ndi jojikombuliwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Lijambu la Amboni lende lu ubambu ukolongu waka Sapanga liilandiwa kwa bandu boti punndema ili bilijowana nukulibona bandu boti. Ndienu mwisu upunndema pagwihika.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Liyomisu lukuhalabana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maluko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>“Pamwibona ‘Liyomisu Lukuhalabana,’ lejalongila mlota waka Sapanga Danieli, lijemiki pandu pa sapi pa Nyumba jaka Sapanga, jojusoma jumanya maana jaki.” <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>Ndienu bandu baabii ku Yudea atilila kuitombi. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Jojubii kunani ja nyumba jaki juhuluka nu kutila bila kujuku sindu mu nyumba jaki. <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Jojubi ku litui jwiikelabuka ku nyumba kujuku ingobu yaki. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Bing'alika ngamaa aka nyongo bini hitumbu na bajongesa mu masoba ge haga! <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Mundoba Sapanga ili kutila kwinu kwikuba mu masoba gi kipepu au Lisoba lu Kupomulela! <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Ndaba kuibiya na mang'aliku makolongu ngasekuwahiki kupitii tumbuka kubombeka kunndema mbaka lelenu, na ngagipiti kabee mang'aliku makolongu ngati haga. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Ana masoba haga nga gakapungiswi, nga mundu jojakalama, lakini ndaba ja bandu bahaguliwi, Sapanga jupungwisi masoba ge haga.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>“Ndienu, mundu najumpwagi lisoba heli, ‘Linga, Kilisitu Nkombosi jubi pamba’ au ‘Jubi palapa,’ mwihobalela. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Ndaba biipitila aka Kilisitu biisoli na alota biisoli. Nabombi biihenga nginyuli ngolongu na ndonduke ili kwaakonga bandu kuwesikana hata bahaguliwi na Sapanga. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Nzowaniya! Nongule kumpwagi lijambu hale kabula masoba kuhika.”<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>“Henu mundu jokapi najumpwaji, ‘Kilisitu Nkombosi jubi kulukoba,’ mwiijenda hoku, au ‘Nndinga jujobiki nkati,’ mwihobale. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Ndaba Mwana waka Mundu kwiibonika ngati unang'anu wikitobi hegunang'ana kunani, kuhuma upandi golipiti lyoba mbaka upandi golijingii lyoba.”<verse eid="MAT 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>Ndaba pokapi pakibii sindu sekiwii ndi paketangana ijuni yebiikikema tai.<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhika kwaka Mwana waka Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maluko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>Apalapa masoba haga egiipeta, liyoba baalijegala lwii, na mwehi ngawinang'ane, na ndondu yiiabuka kuhuma kunani kwaka Sapanga na makili ga hindu yeibii kunani gitenda kunyuka. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Ndienu nginyuli yaka Mwana waka Mundu jiibonikana kunani, na bandu bupunndema biitenda kulobalake, bandu bammbona Mwana waka Mundu juhika mu maundi kunani kwaka Sapanga pamu na makili nu ukolongu wingi. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Sauti ngolongu ja mapenega jiitenda kujowaneka najombi jaatuma atumi baki bu kunani kwaka Sapanga, baabeka pamu baahaguliwi bala kuhuma pandi yoti yu punndema, kuhuma nndema joti.<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malenganu gu nkongu nkoju</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maluko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>“Mulibola lilenganu lende kuhuma mu nkongu wu ntini. Mambandi gaki pagatumbuli kuba gundepwani nukutunduli mahamba, mmanya kuegale kuhusa ilebi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Ahelahe pamwagaabona goti haga mmanya muda guegali. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Numpwagi sakaka, kibeleku senze ngakikui kabula ja majambu ganga kupiti. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Kunani kwaka Sapanga na nndema yoti kwiitenda kupeta lakini malobi gangu ngagiipeti.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngamundu jojumanya lisoba wala lisaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maluko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>“Ngamundu jojumanyiki lisoba wala lisaa, hata atumi bu kunani kwaka Sapanga wala Mwana, ila pee Atati kajika. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Ngati ekwabii mu masoba gaka Noa, ndi ekwibiya ejwihika Mwana waka Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Ndaba masoba haga kabula jukutwele masi punndema bandu akubika akakula na kunywa, atogulika nukutola aka mbomba, mbaka lisoba Noa pajajingala munhwatu nkolongu gobugukema safina. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Bombi ngasebamanyiki siipitila kii mbaka masi pagatwelila punndema nakajola boti. Hela ndi ekwibiya pajihika Mwana waka Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Masoba gegala bandu abeli biibiya ku lituhi, jumu biitenda kunzuku najongi biitenda kundeka. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Aka nyongo abeli biibiya apola kilebi, jumu biitenda kunzuku na jongi biitenda kundeka. <verse eid="MAT 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>Ndienu, ntama mihu ndaba ngasemmanyiki lisoba boo pajwihika Bambu winu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Lakini nkombuka lijambu lende, ngati mwana nyumba ejwakamanyiki lisoba mwii pajihika, jakabiya jutemi mihu, wala ngajikijilei nyumba jaki akonyula. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Ahelahe nanamu mliandia ndaba Mwana waka Mundu juihika mulisaa langa kulimanya mwanganya.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumisi jojihobaleka na jwanga kuhobaleka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>Yesu jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Boo, ntumisi jwaa jojwiihobalika na jwana malangu? Ndi ntumisi jola bambu waki joambeka jwaajemaliya atumisi bangi mu nyumba jaki na kaapeke posu jaki mu masoba gake. <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Mbanga mtumisi jola jojuwe bambu waki pajihika ankolila jakahenga hela. <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Numpwagi sakaka, bambu hoju ammbeka ntumisi hoju jujemaliya hindu yaki yoti. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Lakini ana ntumisi hoju juliya najilipwaji mweni mmwoju waki, ‘Bambu wango juseliwa kuhika.’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>Ndipala jiitumbuliya kwaalapu atumisi ajaki, nukutumbuli kula na kuywa pamu na alepi. <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>Bambu waki jwihika lisoba langa kulihobale ni lisaa langa kulimanya. <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>Ndienu andapula liyaa ntumisi wehoju nukumbeka mulikundi la bandu babilikopake ba amboni, hoku kwiibiya kilelu nukupola minu.<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Lilenganu laka aka kamwali kome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>“Masoba ge haga, Ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga gulengana na aka kamwali komi babajukua taa yabu, nukujenda kunzopa bambu ndoa. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Aka mbomba nhwanu kati jabu babi ang'ang'a na aka kamwali nhwanu bangi babii bana malangu. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Aka kamwali ang'ang'a bala bajukua taa yabu, lakini ngasebatogwi mahuta. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>Lakini aka kamwali bana malangu bala bajukua lisupa lelibii na mahuta pamu na taa yabu. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Bambu ndoa jwaseliwi kuhika, henu aka kamwali bala boka batenda kupotoka nulugonu, nukugone.<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>“Pamaiku kwabiya na keleli, ‘Nzumukaniya, bambu ndoa jutenda kuhika!’ Mpitaniya kunza mukunzopaje. <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Aka kamwali bala bajumukaniya, bapambakiya taa yabo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Aka kamwali ang'ang'a bala baapwagila aka kamwali bana malangu bala, ‘Mtuponguliya mahuta ginu kidogo ndaba taa hitu itenda kususuka.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Lakini aka kamwali bana malangu bala bapwaga, ‘Ngagututosi twabeti na mwanganya! Nambanga nzenda kwa bandu baalombesa mahuta mwakalombaje!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Ndienu aka kamwali ang'ang'a bala pabajenda kulomba mahuta, bambu ndoa jatenda kuhika, aka kamwali bababi ajiandii bala, bajingala pamu najombi mu nyumba ja tipati ga ndoa, nu nndyangu batenda kuupunga.<verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>“Monikatae aka kamwali ang'ang'a bala batenda kuhika, bakema, ‘Bambo, bambo, tuoguliya nndyango!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>Lakini jombi jajibua, ‘Numpwagi sakaka, ngasenummanyi mwanganya.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Ndipala Yesu jwaapwagila, “Ntama mihu heno, ndaba ngasemmanyi lisoba wala lisaa Mwana waka Mundu pajihika.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilenganu la atumisi atatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>“Ahelahe Ukolongu ukunani kwaka Sapanga gulengana na mundu jojupiti kutali, nakakema atumisi baki nakapeke hindu yaki ajemalya. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Ampekia kila jumu kulengana nu uwesu waki, jumu mipuku nhwanu wa mangengalema gu lupija, najongi mipuku mibeli na jongi mpuku gumu, namweni jajenda kutali. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Joampekia mipuku nhwanu jola jahengila lihengu mangengalema ju lupija lola najapata mipuku jengi nhwanu ja mangengalema ju lupija. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Joampekiya mipuku mibeli ja mangengalema ju lupija jola najombi jahengila lihengu nukupata mipuku jengi mibeli ja mangengalema ju lupija. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Lakini joampekia mpuku ulupija gumu jola, jajenda kuemba libomba pai nukuhiya mpuku ulupija lwaka bambu waki.”<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>“Egapeta masoba gingi bambu jola jatenda kukelabuka, jatumbuliya kubalanga lupija pamu nabu. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Ntumisi jojajopiki mipuku jamangalema ju lupija nhwanu jahika nukuleta mipuku jengi unhwano. Japwaaga, ‘Bambu wambeki mipuku nhwanu ju lupija mbatiki mipuku jengi nhwanu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>Bambu waki apwagila, ‘Gutei sapi ngamaa, guntumisi wa amboni na woguhobaleka, guhobaliki kwa hindu hisoku, nagupekiya kujemale mali gingi ngani. Hika gutoguliya pamu na bambu waku.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>Ntumisi jwana mipuku mibeli ju lupija jahika nukupwaga, ‘Bambu gwambeki mipuku ju lupija mibeli. Nane mbatiki mipuku jengi mibeli ju lupija.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>Bambu waki apwagila, ‘Gutei sapi ngamaa, guntumisi wa amboni na weguhobaleka, guhobaliki kwa hindu hisoku nane nagupekia gujemaliya mali gingi ngani. Hika gutoguliya pamu na bambu wako.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>Ndienu jahika ntumisi jojajopa mpuku gumu gu lupija jahika nukupwaga, ‘Bambu nugumanyi weapa wa mundu mbaja, guhusa panga kupanda nu kukusanya panga kukweta imbejo. <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>Najogopa, najenda kuhiya mpuku ulupija lwaku pai jilibomba nukuyelale. Jukua henu mpuku ulupija lwaku.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>Bambu waki ampwagila, ‘Weapa guntumisi uliya nu umpipu! Gumanyi nepani nihusa panga kupanda, kabee ngusanya panga kukweta namweti. <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Henu wakabeka mpuku u lupija lwaku kwa bandu baabeka lupija ili panakakelubuka nakajukua lupija lwangu na longi lolujonzukiki. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Ndienu munnzopa mipuku ju lupija lwe holu mukumpekia jwana mipuku ju lupija komi jela. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Ndaba jojubi na sindu buntenda kunzonzukela. Lakini jwanga na sindu hata sela sejubinaku nasombi biitenda kunzopa. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Ntumisi wehoju jwangakujonzuke lupija! Mundekala kunza kulwii! Hoku kwiibiya ni kilelu nu kupola minu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutemuliwa kwa mwisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>“Mwana waka Mundu pajihika mu ukolongu waki pamu na atumi baki bu kunani kwaka Sapanga, papuje jiitama panani ji kiteu saki su ubambu sekibii nu ukolongu. <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Bandu boti bupundema biiketangana palongi jaki, najombi jwaabaganisa bandu ngati nndimi ejagabaganisa makondoo ni imbui. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Jaabeka makondoo ndi bandu baamboni upandi waki uku malele na imbui ndi bandu baliya upandi wa mangega. <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Ndienu Bambu nkolongu jaapwagila baabii upandi ukumalele bala, ‘Nhikannya mwanganya mompengaliwi na Atati bango, nnzopa ukolongu gobuguhandi ndaba jinu tumbuka kubombeka nndema. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Ndaba nabii ninzala mwanganya mwambekia posu, nabii nanywita mwanganya mwambekia masi, nakabii nungeni mwanganya mwandenda kunyopa kunyumba jii, <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>ngase nabii niingobu mwanganya mwambekiya ingobu, nabii nungonzu mwanganya mwahika kuninga, nabii kukipungu mwanganya mwahika kuninga.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>Ndienu bandu ba mboni bundalukiya nkolongu, ‘Bambo boo, tugubona lii gubii ni inzala natwepani tugupekya posu au wabii lii na nywita na twepani tukupekya masi gakunywa? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Boo lile tugubona gungeni natwepani twatenda kugujopa au ngasewabii ni ingobu natwepani twatenda kuguwatika? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Boo lii wabii gungonzu natwepani twahika kugulinga au lii wabii kukipungu Natwepani twahika kugulinga?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Nkolongu japwaga, Numpwaji sakaka, kila sindu semuntendila jumu jwa alongu bango asoku, nndendila nepani.”<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>“Ndipala jaapwagila bababi upandi waki ukumangega, ‘Mmbokaniya palongi jangu mwanganya mwembiii na yambamba! Nnzendananiya kumwotu wanga kususuka wa yaka petapeta go baandali Lijobi na atumi baki. <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Ndaba nabii ni inzala ngasemwambeki posu, nabii na nywita ngasemwambeki masi gakunywa. <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>Nabii nungeni ngasemwanyopiki kunyumba jii, ngasenabii niingobu ngase mwambeki ingobu nabii nungonzu, kabee nabii numpugwa mwanganya ngase mwahikiki kuninga.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>Ndienu nabombi bapwaga, ‘Bambu, lii tugubona gubi ni inzala na nywita, wabii gungeni au ngase wabii ni ingobu wakabii gungonzu au gumpugwa natwepani ngase tugujangatilee?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Bambu nkolongu jwajibua, ‘Numpwagi sakaka, kila pankanika kunzangati jumu jwanga kumanyikana, nkanika kunyangati nepani.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Ndienu bamba biijingala mwa mang'aliku gukutemuliwa ga yaka petapeta, lakini bandu baamboni haba bijenda kuwomi wa masoba goha.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Majetangane guku nkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Yesu pajajomula kupwaga haga goti, jaapwagila banafunzi baki, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>“Mmanyiki egipeta masoba mabeli gibiya tipati ja Pasaka, Mwana waka Mundu bankamula ili bumbambaliya pu nsalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Masoba ge haga agolu akolongu na aseja ba bandu baketangana pamu pa sengu jaka Kayafa, jojabii nngolu nkolongu. <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>Bataputa indela juu ujanza juku nkamu Yesu nunkukoma. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Lakini baamua lijambu lee liihengeka lisoba la tipati ja Pasaka, ili bandu biileta puju.<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bumpaki mauta gaganungi ku Betania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maluko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Yesu pajwabii ku Betania, mu nyumba jaka Simoni joandamisa ugonzu ukuleleka, <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>mmbomba jumu anhikila koni jutogwi lisupa lealenganisi kwi lilibu lebilikema alabasita lelatweli mahuta gaganungali gabei ngolongu, anzitila Yesu kumutu pajabiya jukula posu. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Banafunzi baki ebabona hela basuki nukupwaga, “Ndaba ja kii kuhoa mahuta hela? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Mahuta ge haga bakalombisa kwa bei ngolongo, lupija lwe bakaapekia aka kapuku.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Yesu jagamanyiki mawasu gabu jaapwajila, “Ndaba jakii munsumbu nyongo jonzo? Jombi juhengiki lijambu la amboni ngamaa. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Aka kapuku mmbinaku masoba goha lakini ngamwikubi na nepani masoba goha. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Nyongo ajo pajanyegi mahuta gaganungi jabiya juandaa nhyega jango ndaba jukujitaga. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Numpwagi sakaka, pokapi pundema pabiilandila Lijambu la Amboni, sejuhengiki nyongo jonzo biilandila sukunkomboka jombi.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda jujetake kung'alambuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maluko 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Ndienu jumu ja banafunzi komi na abeli jobukema Yuda Isikalioti, jajenda kwaka agolu akolongu, <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>jaapwagila, “Mwimbekia sindu boo nanung'anambwiki Yesu?” Bumbalangiya mangengalema makomi matatu gu lupija nukumpeke. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Tumbuka pala, Yuda jabiya jutaputa mbekenyu jukunng'anambuka Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jukula posu ja tipati ja Pasaka na banafunzi baki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maluko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Lisoba lukutumbuli la tipati ga mabumunda ganga kujege amila, banafunzi bunzendila Yesu nukupwagi, “Boo gupala tukuguhandaliya kwako posu ja Pasaka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Jombi japwaga, “Nnzendaniya ku musi kwaka mundu jumu mwanalomi mukupwagila, ‘Mbola jupwaga masoba gangu gahegalii. Nepani na banafunzi bangu twikula posu ja Pasaka mu nyumba jaku.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Ndienu banafunzi bahenga ngati Yesu ejaapwagila, na bombi baandia posu jakula Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Ekwahika pakamii, Yesu jakula posu pamu na banafunzi baki komi na abeli. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Pababia bakakula, Yesu japwaaga, “Numpwagi sakaka jumu wi jwiindenda kung'anambuka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Banafunzi baki gwaabiniki mwoju ngamaa, kila mundu jatumbuliya kundaluki Yesu, “Boo, Bambu, nepane lena?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Yesu jaapwajila, “Jojutobe libumunda laki pamu na nepani mmbakuli ndi jojing'anumbuka. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Mwana waka Mundu jujenda kuwa, ngati eahandiki mu Maandiku gaka Sapanga. Lakini musijikiboni mundu joang'anumbuka Mwana waka Mundu! Kwiibiya mbanga mundu hoju ejakasindiki kusaliwa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Yuda, ndi jojapala kunng'anumbuka andalukiya, “Mbola, boo, nepane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesu jajibua, “Weapa gupwajiki.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Posu jaka Bambu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maluko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Akolintu 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Pababiya bakakula, Yesu jwajukua libumunda, ansengula Sapanga, jamega, jaapekia banafunzi baki japwaga, “Nnzukua mkula, jenze nhyega jango.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Ndipala jajukua nnzipuli wa divai ja zabibu jwasengula, jaapekia koni jupwaga, “Nkunywa mwaboa. <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>Gongo mwai wango wa malagano gogujitika ndaba jakulekake bandu bingi ili alekakiwa mahakau. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Numpwaji ngangunywi kabee divai ja zabibu mbaka lisoba paniikunywa divai inyai pamu nu mbanganya mu Ukolongu wa Atati bango.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Ebajomula kujemba nhwambu gu ulumbi, jaboka jajenda ku Kitombi si Mizeituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu julote Petili jwiitenda kunkana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Ndienu Yesu jaapwajila, “Ikilu ja lelenu, kila mundu musijundenda kundila nukuneka ngati Maandiku gaka Sapanga egapwaga, ‘Nandapula nndimi, nu nsambi wa makondoo wiitenda kupesangana.’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Lakini eniiyoka, nandonguliya kujenda ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Petili apwagila Yesu, “Hata ngati boka baguleka weapa, nepani nganuguleki.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Nugupwagi sakaka, ikilu jenze kabula ji likongobi kubeka wingana mala pa tato.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Petili apwagila, “Nganugukane hata nakupalika kuwa pamu naweapa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Na banafunzi bangi boti bapwaga ahelahela.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu juloba pandu pabapakema Getisemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maluko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Ndipala Yesu jajenda pamu na banafunzi baki pandu pabapakema Getisemani, jaapwajila, “Ntamaniya pamba nane nyenda palapa kundoba Sapanga.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Anzukua Petili pamu na bana abeli baka Zebedayu bala, jatumbuliya kuhangajika nukumbina mwoju. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Papuje japwaaga, “Mwoju wangu gubi nuusungu ngamaa gukuegale kuwa. Ntamaniya kelukelu pamu nanepane.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Jajenda palongi kidogu, jahabuka ukupama nukundoba Sapanga, “Atati bangu, ana kuwesikana, mokia nzipuli ukung'alika gongo kuhuma kwango. Lakini nga ngati embala nepani ila ngati egupala weapa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Ndipala ejwaakelubukiya banafunzi baki, jwaaketaniya agoni. Andalukiya Petili, “Boo ngasemwawesiki kukeluki pamu nanepani hata lisaa limo? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Ntama na nndoba ili mwijingi mu milengu. Loho jipala lakini nhyega ngase jibii namakili.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Yesu jajenda kabee, jaloba, “Atati bangu, ana kuwesakini nnzipuli gukung'alika gongo gumbeta kutali bila kunywa, ila gagupala weapa gahengika.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Pajakelubuka kabee, jaakolila agoni ndaba mihu gabu gabi nulugonu.<verse eid="MAT 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Yesu jaaleka, jajenda kabee kuloba mala ja tatu, jaloba kabee ahelahela. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Ndienu jaajendila banafunzi nakapwaji, “Boo, mwakona nngoni nukupomulela? Nndinga muda guhikiki na Mwana waka Mundu bumpeleka kwa bandu bana mahakau. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Nnzemaniya, tumbokaniya. Nndingaliya, juhika jola jojing'alumbuka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu buntenda kunkamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-52">Luka 22:47-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Yesu pajabiya jakalongila nabu, Yuda jumu ja banafunzi komi na abeli bala, jahika na bandu bingi baatogwi mapanga na ibonga babube babiya ahikiki sukutumwa na agolu akolongu na aseja babandu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Yuda jabiya jaapeki nginyuli jukupwaga, “Mundu jonukukumbatiya jola ndi jombi, mukunkamula.”<verse eid="MAT 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Yuda anzendila Yesu nukupwagi, “Jambu otii Mbola!” Ndi jwatenda kukumbati.<verse eid="MAT 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Yesu jaapwajila, “Nkose, henga seguhikiki kuhenga.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:50">Papuje bandu bala bunhegaliya Yesu nukunkamu nukumbeka pai juulonda wabu. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Jumu ja bandu bababi pamu na Yesu bala jahopula upanga waki andapula ntumisi wa agolu akolongu, nukunseku likutu. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Yesu ampwagila, “Kelubua upanga waku munhaku waki. Ndaba jokapi jojukoma kupete upanga jiikuwa nuupanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Uhambusi ngasenhwesa kwaaloba Atati bangu anetila hikundi ya alonda komi na abele ba atumisi bu kunani ahika kunyangatila? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Lakini giitimia boo Maandiku gaka Sapanga ganga gagapwaga majambu ge haga kupalika gapitila?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Apalapa Yesu jugupwajila nsambi wa bandu bala, “Boo, nhikiki kungamu kwa mapanga niibonga nepani ngati lee jojuhalabana malagalaki gaka Sapanga? Kila lisoba nabii pamu numbanganya pa Nyumba jaka Sapanga nakabolisa, ngasemwangamwi. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Lakini ganga gapiti ili gaandiki alota baka Sapanga gatimia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Ndipala banafunzi baki bundeka nukutila.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu palongi ja sengu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maluko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Babunkamula Yesu bala bumpelika kunyumba jaka Kayafa, nngolu nkolongu, kobaketangini abola bamalagalaki na aka kilongosi. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Petili ampwata sukutali mbaka paua jaka Nngolu nkolongu. Jajingala nkati jatama pai na alonda ili juwesa kulinga gagiibiya. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Agolu akolongu na sengu joka bataputa malobi gi isoli ili bunkoma Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>lakini ngasebapata malobi gokapai, hata ngati bahikiki bandu bingi babapwaga malobi giisoli. Ndipala pamwisu we baika bandu abeli, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>bapwaaga, “Mundu jonzo japwaga, ‘Nhwesa kubombo Nyumba jaka Sapanga nukusenga kabee kwa masoba matato.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Nngolu nkolongu jajema nukundaluki Yesu, “Boo ngasegubi nu sukupwaga? Boo bandu aba bugutakii ndaba jakikee?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Lakini Yesu ngasejapwajiki sindo. Nngolu nkolongu ampwagila, “Nugulapisa kwaka Sapanga jojubi mwomi. Utupwajila anaweapa ndi wa Kilisitu Nkombosi Mwana waka Sapanga!”<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Yesu japwaaga, “Weapa gupwaga. Lakini numpwagi mwaboti tumbuka sajenu nukuendalee mwambona Mwana waka Mundu jutemi upandi wa malele waka Sapanga jwana makili, jwihika panani ja mahundi gukunani kwaka Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Pajajowana Nngolu nkolongu malobi haga jajendula ingobu jaki nukupwaga, “Jutenda kutondoka. Ngasetupala mundu jongi juhika kuntakila kabee? Mwabee nzowini ejutondwiki. <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Boo mwanganya mmbona bole?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Bombi bajibua, “Jubii na makosa kupalika jukomikaje.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Ndipala buhunila imata kumihu, nukundapu. Bangi babiya bundapu iganza <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>koni bakapwaga, “Wehapa gu Kilisitu Nkombosi! Lotila nya jojugulapwi?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petili ankana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maluko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Petili jabii nkati ja hua. Ntumisi jumu mmbomba anzendila nukumpwagi, “Na wehapa wabii pamu na Yesu mwenei ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Lakini Petili jakana palongi jabu jwapwaga, “Ngasemanyiki segumpwaga.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Ndienu pajapita kunza, kola ntumisi jongi mmbomba ambona, jaapwagila bandu boti bababi pala, “Mundu jonzo jabii pamu na Yesu juku Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Petili jakana kabee kukulapa, “Ngasenummanyi mundu ajo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Monikatae bandu babajemiki pala bunzendila Petili bumpwagila, “Sakaka weapa ndi jumu wabu, ndaba hata kulonge kwaku kubonikana wehapa guhumi ku Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Ndienu petili jatumbuliya kulilobe yaambamba nukulapa sukupwaga, “Ngasenumanyi mundu ajo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Apalapa likongobi latenda kubeka. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Petili jakombuka malobi gajwapwaga Yesu, “Kabula likongobi ngaselibekiki wingana mala pa tato.” Ndienu japita kunza koni julela ku usungu.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu bumpeleka kwaka Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maluko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohana 18:28-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Pulukela aka agolu akolongu boti na aka aseja ba bandu batenda kulongalane baamua kunkoma Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Bunkonga, bunzukua nukumpeleka kwaka Pilatu, jojabi kilongosi ju pundema jojahaguliwi nu nkolongu juku Loma.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwaka Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Mahengu 1:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Yuda, joang'anambuka Yesu, pajwabona Yesu atenda kuntemu, gumbina mwoju, jwaakelabukia agolu akolongu bala na aseja, mangengalema makomi matatu gulupija yela.<verse eid="MAT 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>Jwaapwagila, “Ndei mahakau ndaba nung'anambwiki mundu jwanga mahakau ili jukomika.” Lakini bombi bapwaga, “Kwali wamwete, twepani ngasetuhusika.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Henu Yuda jwalekala pee lupija lola pa Nyumba jaka Sapanga, ndienu japita kunza nukujenda kulikonge.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Agolu akolongu bajukua lupija lola, nukupwaga, “Lupija alo ngaselupalika kulubeka pi kikoku sa Nyumba jaka Sapanga, ndaba londo lupija lobapia ndaba jukukome.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Ndi bajetangania lupija lola kulombe litui la bandu baabombe ibega pabia pandu pukutagi bandu ageni. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Ndienu mbaki lelenu litui lela bilikema, “Litui lelalombika kupete lupija lukukome.”<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Ndi gatimia gajwapwaga mlota waka Sapanga Yelemia pajwapwaga, “Bajukua mangengalema makomi matatu gulupija yebajetangana bandu buku Izilaeli kundepe, <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>balombila litui la bandu babomba ibega, ngati Bambu hejanagalakiya nepani.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilatu andaluki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maluko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohana 18:33-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Yesu jajemiki palongi juku nkolongu ju Loma. Ndi Nkolongu hoju anndalukia, “Boo, weapa lee ndi Bambu Nkolongu jwa Ayaude?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesu japwaga, “Upwagiki weapa.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Lakini agolu akolongu na aseja pababia atenda kuntaki, ngasejwajibwiki lilobe.<verse eid="MAT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Ndienu pilatu andalukia Yesu, “Boo, ngasegujogwana matakilu gabugutakali weapa?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Lakini Yesu ngase jwajibwiki hata lilobi limu, nkolongu juku Loma jola jwasangi ngamaa.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu buntemu jukomika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maluko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Kila lisoba la tipati ja Pasaka, nkolongu juku Loma jayobali kunhuhogule mpungwa jumu bandu babumpai. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Masoba gala jwabi mpungwa jumu jojwamanyikini ngamaa, liina laki Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Ndi bandu hebakusanyiki pamu, Pilatu jwaalalukia, “Mpala nunhogulia nyane kati ja bandu abeli haba? Boo, nundekakiya Balaba au Yesu jobunkema Kilisituje?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Pilatu jwapwaga hela ndaba jwamanyiki bundeta Yesu kwaki ndaba bumbonila wipu.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Pilatu pajwabia jutemi pikiteu sukutemu, nhwanu waki ampelakia lilobi, “Wiitenda sokapi kwaka mundu ajo jwanga mahakau, ndaba lelenu ikilu ng'aliki ngamaa nndotu ndaba jaki.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Lakini agolu akolongu naaka aseja baakolua bandu bundoba Pilatu bunndekakia Balaba na Yesu jukuwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Pilatu jwaalalukia kabee, “Jwaa kati ja baamba jompala nundekakiyaje?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Bajibua, “Balaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilatu jwaalalukia, “Henu nuntenda boo Yesu jobunkema Kilisitu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Boti bapwaga, “Umbambaliaje pu nsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Pilatu jwaalalukia, “Ndaba ja kike? Jutei ubaja bole?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Bombi baendalia kujamali kwa sauti koni bakapwaga, “Umbambalia punsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Pilatu hejwamanya ngajuwesi kutenda sokapi na puju japala kutumbuli, jwajukua masi, nukusamba maboku palongi ja bandu bala nukupwaga, “Nengasemii na mahakau kupete kuwa kwaka mundu ajo, namu kwali mwabee.” <verse eid="MAT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Bandu boka bapwaga, “Mahakau ga kuwa kwaki gabiya panani jitu na panani ja bana bitu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Ndipala Pilatu andekakiya Balaba ndaba jabu jupita mukipungu, na jaapwagila bunndapula Yesu iboku nukumbambali pu nsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alonda bunndongama Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maluko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Ndienu alonda baka Pilatu bumpelika Yesu mu nyumba jaka Pilatu, nu nsambi wa alonda bunnyongulota Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Bunhula ingobu yaki, bunhuwatika lingobu likeli lu ubambu. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Ndipala baloka kihilingu sa miha, nukunhwatika kumutu jaki, bumbekila kabee nndai mu kuboku kwaki kwa malele. Bapega magoti palongi jaki, bundongama bapwaaga, “Jambu oti Bambu nkolongu jwa Ayaudi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Bunhunila imata, buujukua nndai gola, bundapula nagu kumutu. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Pabajomula kundongama, bunhula kanzu ngeli jela nukunhwatika kabee ingobu yaki. Nukumpeleka kumbambali punsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bumbambali pu nsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Pababia atenda kujenda, baketangana na mundu jumu bunkema Simoni, mwenei juku Kilene, bunndasimisa kutoto nsalaba waka Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Pabahika pandu pabapakema Goligota maana jaki pandu pi Lihupa li Kimutu, <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Bumpekia divai jeahangangini na sindu sekibaba, lakini Yesu pajwaonza jwakanaa kunywa.<verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Batenda kumbambali pu nsalaba, nukubagana ingobu yaki sukugapege gudugudu. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Ndienu pala batama pai koni bukunndonda. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Panani jaki babeka lilobi lelilangi ndaba jukutakiliwa kwaki: “Jonzo ndi Yesu Bambu Nkolongu jwa Ayaudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Bii abeli nabombi baabambalia panani ju nsalaba pamu na Yesu, jumu upandi uku mangegi na gongi upandi uku malele.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Bandu bababia apeta pala, banyua imutu yabu koni bukundongama nukuntondoo bakapwaga, <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>“Oo! We si wapwaga wiibombula nyumba jaka Sapanga nukusenga masoba gatatu? Henu, uliokua wa mweti! Ana sakaka weapa wa mwana waka Sapanga huluka pu nsalaba hapa sajenu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Ahelahe agolu akolongu pamu na abola ba Malagalaki na aseja nabombi batenda kunndongama koni bakapwaga, <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>“Jwaakombula bangi, lakini jusindwa kulioko mweni! Ati jombi Bambu nkolongu jwa Ayahude! Henu julihulua pu nsalaba natwepani tunhobaliaje. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Jombi anhobalia Sapanga na jwapwaga jombi Mwana waka Sapanga. Ana Sapanga ampala jombi anhokuaje.<verse eid="MAT 27:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>“Kabee bababi abambaliwi pu nsalaba pamu najombi batenda kuntondo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jukua pu nsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Tumbuka lisaa la sita mbaka lisaa la tisa, lwii lwijiyekalia ndema joti. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Hekwabia saa tisa lyobamutu Yesu jwalela sukujamali, “Eloi, Eloi Lama sabakitani?” Maana jaki, “Sapanga wangu, Sapanga wangu, ndaba jaki undei kuneka?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Bandu bangi babajemiki pala bala pabajogwana bapwaga, “Ankema Elia.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Apalapa jumu wabu jwaboka imbelu nukujuku kipongu, nukukijingi mu divai jejibaba nukukikonga punndai nukuntondabake Yesu jukunywa.<verse eid="MAT 27:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Bangi bapwaaga, “Tunndolake hoti ana Elia juhika kugombo.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Yesu jwalela kabee sukujamali kwa sauti ngolongu, ndienu na kuwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Apalapa lipazia lu mu Nyumba jaka Sapanga lajenduka ipandi ibeli, toka kunani mbaka pai, ndema jatenda kubagaja malibu makolongu gatenda kusekuka, <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>mmatenge gatenda kuhukuka na bandu bingi baka Sapanga babawi batenda kuyoka. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Nabombi bapita kunza ja matenge na Yesu pajayoka bajenda ku musi wa sapi uku Yelusalemu na bandu bingi baabweni.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Ndienu nkolongu jwaalonda jumu na bangi bababia pamu najombi bukundonda Yesu, pababona kililima sa ndema na majambu gagapitila gala, bajogupa ngamaa, bapwaga, “Sakaka jonzo jabii Mwana waka Sapanga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Pandu je pala babii aka mbomba abeli bakalingalia sukutali. Haba ndi babumpwata Yesu kuhuma ku Galilaya ndi babuhudumia. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Jwabii Malia juku Magidala na Malia amabu baka Yakobu na Josepu na amabu baka bana baka Zebedayu.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuntaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Pakamihi jwahika mundu jumu mwana mali mwenei juku Alimatayo, liina laki Josepu. Najombi jwabia mbolee waka Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Anzendila Pilatu nukuloba ampekia nhyega jaka Yesu. Ndienu Pilatu jwalagalakia bumpekya. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Josepu jwajukua nhyega jaka Yesu jela, jwiiyongalatia ingobu nhuu. <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>Josepu jabeka nhyega jaka Yesu nkati jilitenge laki linyai lejwabi julisongiki mweni pililibu. Ndienu juliingalatiya lilibu likolongu palongi junndyangu ulitengee nu kuboka. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Malia juku Magidala na Malia jongi jola babia atemi papu kulilingali litengee.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alonda bililonda litenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Kilabu jaki, labia lisoba lukuandaa Lisoba lu Kupomulela, Agolu akolongu na aka Afalisayu bunzendila Pilatu, <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>bumpwagila, “Nkolongo, tukomboka jojulonge isoli jola pajabi mwomi jwapwaga ati, ‘Nagapetiki masoba matatu nitenda kuyoka.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Enu gulagalakia litenge laki bililonda sapi mbaka lisoba la tatu ili banafunzi baki bihika kujiba nhyega jaki nakaapwaji bandu jutei kuyoka. Isoli heji jamwisu jibia jiliya ngani kupeta jejatumbulia.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilatu jwapwaga, “Alonda mmbii nabu, nzendania mwaka londa ngati henhwesa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Ndi bajenda, bililonda litenge, bilibeka halama panani ji lilibu lela nakaabeka alonda.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyoka kwaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maluko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Elapeta Lisoba lu Kupomulela, lisoba la juma pili pulukela ngani, Malia juku Magidala na Malia jongi jola bajenda kulinga litenge lela. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Apalapa sapitila kililima kikolongu pundema, ndaba ntumi jukunani waka Bambu jwatenda kuhuluka kuhuma kunani, juliingalitia lilibu lela pulutengu nukulitami panani. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Ntumi we jola jwang'ala ngati unang'anu ukitobi ni ingobu yaki yabia ihuu kupukupu. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Alonda bilitenge batenda kubagaja sulujogopu lukolongu, mbaka babia ngati atei kua.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Lakini ntumi jukunani jola jwaapwagila aka mbomba bala, “Mwee mwijogopa!” Japaga, “Nepani manyiki muntaputa Yesu jobumbambaliya pu nsalaba jola. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Ngasejubi pane, juyokiki ngati hejupwagike. Nhika nndingalia pandu pajwabii jugonile. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Henu, nzendania nyata mwakaapwagila banafunzi baki, ‘Yesu juyokiki kuhuma kwa bandu baa wile, na henu junndonguli ku Galilaya, mwaambona hakolakola.’ Nkombuka senumpwaji.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Aka mbomba bala baboka ku litenge kola koni ajogopa ngamaa na mioju jabu jitweli ndogulela nukujombatake kwaapwagi banafunzi baki.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Apalapa, Yesu jwaketangana nabu nakwaapwagi, “Jambu oti.” Aka mbomba bala bunzendila, nukukamu magolu gaki nukungungamali. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Ndienu Yesu jwaapwagila, “Mwiijogopa! Nzendania mwakaapwagila alongu bangu ajendania ku Galilaya nakola biimona nepani.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alonda bilitenge apwaga sesapitila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Aka mbomba bala pababia atenda kuyetuana, aka alonda baakumu bilitenge bajenda ku musi kwaalandi agolu akolongu goti gagapitii kulitenge. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Ndienu, agolu akolongu baketangana pamu na aseja, ebajomula kulongalane bajetangania, baapekia alonda bilitenge bala lupija lwingi, <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>ndipala bapwaga, “Mwanganya mwiipwaga ana, ‘Banafunzi baki bahika kunziba ikilu, twepani twabii tugoni.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Ana kilongosi ju ndema jumanyiki lijambu heli, twepani twiitenda kunkolo jujetakia, namwanganya ngamwikubi namang'aliku.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Alonda bala bajukua lupija lola, batenda ngati hebaapwagila. Nilijambu heli laheni kwaka Ayaudi mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu jwaapiti banafunzi baki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mahengu 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Banafunzi komi na jumu bala bajenda ku Galilaya kukitombi sejwaalagalakia Yesu ajenda. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Pabumbona Yesu batenda kungungamali, lakini bangi babu babiya ngaseanhobale. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Yesu jwahika pambipi jabu na kwaapwagi, “Ambekii uwesu woka kunani nu pundema. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Nzendania kwa bandu boti bupundema mwakaatenda bandu boti abia banafunzi bangu, mwakaabatisa kwiliina la Atati na laka Mwana na laka Loho jaka Sapanga, <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>mwaabola kukamu malagalaki goti ganundagalaki. Nanepani mi pamu na mwanganya masoba goha mbaka mwisu gu nndema.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
